INSERT INTO `oc_category_multiparent` VALUES (1,0,49,'Online Flower Delivery','<h2>Online Flower Deliver in India</h2><p>Occasions, special occasions or no occasion\'s a bouquet of flowers can be gifted for any occasion with online flower delivery services. Be it Birthday, Anniversary, Wedding, Valentine\'s Day or any other day, flowers are the most suitable gift to ensure a guaranteed smile on your dear one\'s face, so send flowers to wish them from any part of India. You can order <a href=\"/\">flowers online</a> from Bookmyflowers which has a whole new variety of flowers from the crimson velvet flowers to the delicate white Daisies and the colorful Tulips. All these flowers are carefully tied and neatly embraced with a soft paper to keep it as fresh as they have been instantly plucked from the gardens.</p></br><p>All you need to do is just order flowers or a bouquet of flowers and you can firmly believe that we will be delivering it dot on time so that the moment doesn\'t get spoilt. Adorn it with a beautiful handwritten message to add a little bit of your own creativity and make your dear one feel extra special. You can order from a big bunch to small <a href=\"/flower-bouquets\">bouquet of flowers online</a> for your dear one\'s to make their day larger than life.</p>','Order Bouquet of flowers, Online Flower Delivery, Send Flowers to India','Bookmyflowers offers variety bouquet of flowers online at affordable prices. Place your order to send beautiful flower arrangement in India with our online flower delivery services.','Online Florist,Bouquet of Flowers,Online Flower Delivery In India, Flower Bouquet, Send flowers to India, Online flower delivery, Flower delivery in India',''),(2,0,11,'Buy Cakes Online','<h2>Buy and order cakes online in India</h2><p>Bookmyflowers has emerged as one of the ideal choices for people to avail for professionally managed online cake delivery system. We at Bookmyflowers have made it possible for people to order the most desirable cakes at the cheapest possible rates. We take pride in being the most professional service provider for ordering <a href=\"/birthday/cakes\">online cakes for birthday</a>, anniversary in India</strong>. We provide a platform to people to <strong>order cakes online India</strong> and aim to provide the best deals to them. We specialize in all types of cakes to make any occasion memorable.</p></br> <p>In order to place <strong>online order for cake</strong>, all that people need to do is to log in to the website, choose the cakes and place the order through some simple steps. While deciding to <strong>buy cake online</strong>, people can be ensured that the required products would be delivered on time and at the right place. Our rates are extremely affordable which makes people prefer us over others.</p>','Buy and send Cakes to India, Online Cake delivery on order - Bookmyflowers','Order cakes online: Cakes are the showstoppers of any occasion.  Looking for best cakes to buy and send to India than explore our variety of popular cakes for different occasions.','Cake Delivery Online,Send Cakes India,Cake Delivery India,Buy Cakes Online',''),(3,0,135,'Same Day Flower Delivery','<h2>Get Same Day Flowers and Cakes Home Delivery</h2><p>Sending flower is the best way to  express love, gratitude, courtesy and condolences. Bookmyflowers offers you  an opportunity to convey your warmth and love to your dear ones with its  fastest same day cake and flowers home delivery service. We offer a wide range of <a href=\"/flower-arrangements\">exclusive flowers arrangement</a> for all types of occasions and the best part is that all our flower arrangements are available for <strong>same day flower delivery</strong>. </p> </br> <p>One can place an online flowers home  delivery order for same day , the next day or for any other day. Our flower  arrangements boast of fresh flowers that are chosen as per sender&rsquo;s choice and  impressively wrapped. Our impressive flower presentation and