re fact as to who will win the pillow.</p> </br>  <p>Personalized Mother\'s Day gifts have an art of adding a charm of its own. You can send it online and make your mother feel special. It also has the ability to take your love ahead with a notch. You can send gifts which she is going to treasure for a lifetime. Tell her loudly that you were never able to express it but you love her more than anything else in the world.</p>','Personalized Mother\'s day gifts online - Bookmyflowers','Have a look at our unique Mother\'s day special personalized gifts. Choose a best personalized gifts for your mom for this day.','Mothers Day Personalized Gifts',''),(320,172,82,'Bhai Dooj Gifts Online ','<h2>Online Bhai Dooj Gifts for Brother and Sister</h2><p>Celebrated on the last day of five-day-long diwali festival, Bhai Dooj is the one day festival which celebrates the love shared by brother and sister. Although Bhai Dooj is similar to Rakshabandhan but instead of receiving gifts, sisters present gifts to their brothers. It is believed that he who gets vermillion put on his forehead by his sister on the day of Bhai Dooj is blessed with nirvana and a prosperous life. The ceremony begins with fasting till the auspicious ceremony of Bhai Dooj is not complete. Sister applies vermillion on her brother\'s forehead and treats him with his favourite sweets and gifts.</p></br> <p>Known for its on-time delivery, Bookmyflowers offers wide array of <strong>Bhai Dooj gifts for brother</strong> that are reasonably priced and have flexible delivery options. At our web portal you can find <strong>Bhai Dooj gifts online</strong> that will help you find the best gift for your adorable brother without having to run around the market. Nowadays brothers display love for their sisters who live far away from them by sending Bhai Dooj gifts for sisters. With worldwide delivery options, Bookmyflowers strives to make every celebration a joyous occasion.</p> </br><strong><h2>Send Bhai Dooj Gifts to India</h2></strong><p>You can send Bhai Dooj gifts to India and surprise your beloved sibling who has always made it a point to remind you of the love they hold for you. Our portal offers delicious bhaiya dooj gift hampers of traditional Indian sweets, dry fruits and chocolates that can be combined with delicious cakes or cupcakes and freshly plucked flowers that will make the day even more special. Order today and send online Bhai Dooj gifts to India from any part of the world.</p></br><p>Bhai Dooj is a festival celebrated in India on the last day of the five-day-long Diwali festival. This is the second day of the bright fortnight of the Hindu lunar month of Kartik. The celebrations of this day are almost similar to that of the festival of Rakshabandhan. On this day, sisters wake up early and decorate the <strong>Bhai Dooj special pooja thali</strong> and pray for a long and happy life for their brothers, by performing the Tika ceremony. Another feature of this festival is the exchange of presents and gifts between brothers and sisters.</p></br><p>Order Bhai Dooj gifts online from our portal and have them delivered in time for the occasion and ceremony. We offer a wide range of exclusive festival gifts and if you are looking for specific items like <strong>Bhai Dooj gifts for sisters</strong> or brother, then you have arrive at the right destination.  Ranging from dry fruits to traditional sweets and other assorted gift combos, you are sure to find your exact choice of gift in our selection. Dry fruits are a popular and traditional gift item and they also give a healthier and nutritional advantage. Send your loved ones our Pinni and Dry fruits basket, this combination of delicacies like baadam pinni, cashews and almonds in an attractive little basket is an absolute stunner. We also offer a variety of <a href=\"/rakhi/chocolates\">chocolate hampers</a> and other fascinating combinations.If you want to send Bhai Dooj gifts abroad, we provide delivery services to both domestic