ot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n              Lasting Beauty&lt;/td&gt;\r\n            &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sunflower&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n              Pure Thoughts&lt;/td&gt;\r\n            &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sweet Pea&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n              Delicate Pleasure&lt;/td&gt;\r\n            &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tulip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n              Declaration of Love&lt;/td&gt;\r\n          &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n        &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n      &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n      &lt;tr&gt;\r\n        &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n      &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n    &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n   \r\n&lt;/div&gt;',' Flowers Meaning',' Flowers Meaning',' Flowers Meaning'),(11,1,'Valentine Disclaimer ','&lt;div class=&quot;my_account_left&quot;&gt;\r\n   		&lt;div class=&quot;my_account_top&quot;&gt;\r\n \r\n&lt;div class=&quot;other_link&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\nDear Customer,\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nYour order is valuable to us. We would like you to understand &amp;amp; appreciate how much we care for your orders. Please go through the disclaimers &amp;amp; stay informed.\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;b&gt;Valentine’s Special Express/ Same Day Delivery Services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nWe have put together a beautiful collection for you here bookmyflower.in. The prices shown may change without prior notice due to Valentine’s rush. Pre-book your orders to enjoy attractive rates. For express delivery products we are unable to commit to an exact time of delivery. This option is only available for Fixed - Time Delivery &amp;amp; Midnight Delivery products. In order to help service your orders in the best possible way, we request you to provide the correct address and contact details of the recipients. \r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nAn email id will help us get in touch with the recipient when the phone is not accessible. Please read our disclaimers with respect to midnight &amp;amp; international delivery. You will find all the information that you will need on our Disclaimer section &lt;a href=&quot;/static/shippingdisclaimer.dot&quot;&gt;Shipping Disclaimer&lt;/a&gt;. If you have more questions, please feel free to get in touch with us here &lt;a href=&quot;/product/contactus.dot&quot;&gt;Contact Us&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;b&gt;Valentine’s Special Midnight Delivery Services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nWe have put together a beautiful collection for you here bookmyflower.in. The prices shown may change without prior notice due to Valentine’s rush. Pre-book your orders to enjoy attractive rates. For Midnight delivery orders, please note that the order may be delivered between 11pm to 1am due to a high volume of orders. In order to help service your orders in the best possible way, we request you to provide the correct address and contact details of the recipients. An email id will help us get in touch with the recipient when the phone is not accessible. \r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nYou will find all the information that you will need on our Disclaimer section &lt;a href=&quot;/static/shippingdisclaimer.dot&quot;&gt;Shipping Disclaimer&lt;/a&gt;. If you have more questions, please feel free to get in touch with us here &lt;a href=&quot;/product/contactus.dot&quot;&gt;Contact Us&lt;/a&gt;. If you wish we do not contact the recipient, please call our customer care support and notify them about the same. Please be aware that we may experience slight delay in delivery confirmation during the peak season time.\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;b&gt;Valentine’s Special Courier Services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nWe have put together a beautiful collection for you here bookmyflower.in The prices shown may change without prior notice due to Valentine’s rush. Pre-book your orders to enjoy attractive rates. All gifts are delivered by our courier partners - we are hence unable to guarantee an exact date/time of delivery during the peak season. In order to help service your orders in the best possible way, we request you to provide the correct address and contact details of the recipients. \r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nAn email id will help us get in touch with the recipient when the phone is not accessible. You will find all the information that you will need on our Disclaimer section &lt;a href=&quot;/static/shippingdisclaimer.dot&quot;&gt;Shipping Disclaimer&lt;/a&gt;. If you have more questions, please feel free to get in touch with us here &lt;a href=&quot;/product/contactus.dot&quot;&gt;Contact Us&lt;/a&gt;. Please be aware that we may experience slight delay in delivery confirmation during the peak season time.\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\n&lt;b&gt;Valentine’s Special International Services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nThe prices shown may change without prior notice due to Valentine’s rush. Pre-book your orders to enjoy attractive rates. Please be aware of our substitution policy for hand delivery products. For next day courier products, we are unable to guarantee an exact time/date of delivery during the peak season. We use our best discretion to deliver the gifts in the event the recipient is not available at the venue. Please allow 3-5 working days for delivery confirmation &amp;amp; dispute resolution during the Valentine’s peak season.\r\n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\r\nPlease allow 1-2 working days for updates due to time zone differences. In order to help service your orders in the best possible way, we request you to provide the correct address and contact details of the recipients. An email id will help us get in touch with the recipient when the phone is not accessible. You will find all the information that you will need on our Disclaimer 