 Eggless 1kg  ','The Chocolate For Lovers 1Kg Cake is made in tempting chocolate flavor with even more tempting decoration. &lt;strong&gt;(Please add packet of Candles &amp; Knife along with cake)&lt;/strong&gt;','chocolate for lovers eggless 1kg, f17-mbcake46, black forest cakes','Chocolate For Lovers Eggless 1kg  - The Chocolate For Lovers 1Kg Cake is made in tempting chocol','Chocolate For Lovers Eggless 1kg  , The Chocolate For Lovers 1Kg Cake is made in tempting chocolate flavor with even more tempting decoration. (Please add packet of Candles &amp; Knife along with cake)','chocolate for lovers eggless 1kg, f17-mbcake46, black forest cakes'),(579,1,'In Love With Pineapple Eggless 1kg  ','Our bakers make this 1 Kg cake in the all-time favorite pineapple flavor with fruit and milk chocolate garnishing. &lt;strong&gt;(Please add packet of Candles &amp; Knife along with cake)&lt;/strong&gt;','in love with pineapple eggless 1kg, f17-mbcake40, black forest cakes','In Love With Pineapple Eggless 1kg  - Our bakers make this 1 Kg cake in the all-time favorite pine','In Love With Pineapple Eggless 1kg  , Our bakers make this 1 Kg cake in the all-time favorite pineapple flavor with fruit and milk chocolate garnishing. (Please add packet of Candles &amp; Knife along wit','in love with pineapple eggless 1kg, f17-mbcake40, black forest cakes'),(580,1,'Meditating Buddha Statue','&lt;p&gt;A simple yet classic piece of art for your lovely living space. This Buddha statue will surely add peace to your ambience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your gift contains: &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Black &amp; yellow Buddha statue 4.5 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Meditating Buddha Statue','Meditating Buddha Statue','Meditating Buddha Statue','Meditating Buddha Statue'),(581,1,'Composed Buddha Hamper','Add visual charm while bringing in peace and divinity to your surrounding with this serene hamper from Ferns N Petals. Hamper includes 6 inches resting Buddha figure sitting contemplatively with his head on his knee, with beautiful detailing to the antiqued finish head dress and robe along with 100 grams potpourri, 1 round silver candle and 2 layers lucky bamboo plant in a glass vase.','Composed Buddha Hamper','Composed Buddha Hamper','Composed Buddha Hamper','Composed Buddha Hamper'),(582,1,'Sleeping Buddha','&lt;p&gt;A serene idol of Buddha to spread positivity in the house of your loved ones. It looks so beautiful and peaceful, it is sure to grab the attention of everyone.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One sleeping Buddha idol.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sleeping Buddha','Sleeping Buddha','Sleeping Buddha','Sleeping Buddha'),(583,1,'Elegant Buddha Statue','&lt;p&gt;A serene and elegant statue of lord Buddha to bring glory in the house. Send this as a gift to a dear one or simply keep it in your house.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Idol of Buddha.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Elegant Buddha Statue','Elegant Buddha Statue','Elegant Buddha Statue','Elegant Buddha Statue'),(584,1,'Lucky and Laughing Buddha','&lt;p&gt;Laughing Buddha is suppose to bring lots of luck and success in the life of the people. Gift it to the person you really care for to see them prosper in life.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Laughing Buddha statue.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Lucky and Laughing Buddha','Lucky and Laughing Buddha','Lucky and Laughing Buddha','Lucky and Laughing Buddha'),(585,1,'Enlightened Buddha','&lt;p&gt;Buddha - A symbol of pure character! This welcome Buddha with Jamia is perfect to place at the entrance. it is perfect choice for all those who seek complete peace of mind in their lives. This sculpted Buddha is a great idea for gifting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Jamia&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Welcome Buddha 9 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Enlightened Buddha','Enlightened Buddha','Enlightened Buddha','Enlightened Buddha'),(586,1,'Traditional Ganesha','&lt;p&gt;Delight your dear ones with the idol of lord Ganesha which looks very traditional and auspicious. Intricately carved, this idol will make for a very pleasing gift.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; An idol of lord Ganesha.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Traditional Ganesha','Traditional Ganesha','Traditional Ganesha','Traditional Ganesha'),(587,1,'Budhha for All','Give your home space a divine and peaceful atmosphere with a peaceful Buddha statue. Get a black Resting Buddha figure sitting contemplatively with his head on his knee, with beautiful detailing to the antiqued finish head dress and robe from Ferns N Petals. To add more we have also included a 2 layers lucky bamboo plant and 1 round silver candle to the deal.','Budhha for All','Budhha for All','Budhha for All','Budhha for All'),(588,1,'Serene Meditating Buddha','&lt;p&gt;A serene idol of lord Buddha to give a calming sensation to your loved ones. It is perfect to adore the house or send as a gift.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Idol of lord Buddha.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Serene Meditating Buddha','Serene Meditating Buddha','Serene Meditating Buddha','Serene Meditating Buddha'),(589,1,'Symbol of Piece','&lt;p&gt;Is your loved one heading into a new home or just starting a new phase of life? Then this exquisitely designed Buddha head would be a perfect choice. The Meditating Lord Buddha can be gifted to them as a token of peace and prosperity. A perfect choice for all those who wish to attain complete balance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Buddha Head 7 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Symbol of Piece','Symbol of Piece','Symbol of Piece','Symbol of Piece'),(590,1,'Harmony with Exclusivity','&lt;p&gt;Symbol of faith and serenity, this artistically designed Lord Buddha statue is perfect for placing in pray area, work place or a wise selection for gifting to family and friends. This Buddha gift is perfect to make your home abode of peace and happiness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Welcome Buddha 9 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Harmony with Exclusivity','Harmony with Exclusivity','Harmony with Exclusivity','Harmony with Exclusivity'),(591,1,'Bring Buddha Home With Luck','Meditating Buddha is a very powerful method of healing ourself and others and for overcoming the inner sickness of attachment, hatred and ignorance. Get a serene hamper of 6 inches Resting Buddha figurine along with 2 layers Lucky Bamboo plant in a fibre vase and 1 round silver candle beautifully placed in a wooden tray from Ferns N Petals.','Bring Buddha Home With Luck','Bring Buddha Home With Luck','Bring Buddha Home With Luck','Bring Buddha Home With Luck'),(592,1,'Peaceful Buddha Statue','&lt;p&gt;Peace comes from within','Peaceful Buddha Statue','Peaceful Buddha Statue','Peaceful Buddha Statue','Peaceful Buddha Statue'),(593,1,'Traditional Belief Showpiece','&lt;p&gt;This Gautam Buddha idol is perfect to bring prosperity and happiness to your living space in your home. This black meditating Buddha paired with scented candle in red glass pot arranged on brown flat tray is ideal gift for any occasion - be it wedding gift, corporate gift etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Scented Candle in Red Glass Pot height 5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Brown Flat Tray 9x11&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Black Meditating Buddha 6 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Traditional Belief Showpiece','Traditional Belief Showpiece','Traditional Belief Showpiece','Traditional Belief Showpiece'),(594,1,'Resting Buddha','&lt;p&gt;What could be a better gift to bring Lord Buddha as a symbol of peace? Designed beautifully, this black meditating Buddha has been enthusiastically crafted with various conventional techniques and is embellished with glass vases and T-lights, all arranged on a brown flat tray.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Brown Flat Tray 9x11&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Black Meditating Buddha 6 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Glass vase with 3 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 T-light&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Resting Buddha','Resting Buddha','Resting Buddha','Resting Buddha'),(595,1,'Lamp of Traditional Belief','&lt;p&gt;Traditional Buddha shaped light is designed magnificiently to beautify your home dï¿½cor. Beautiful white print on outer surface adds sparkle to this sculpture cum magical light. Crafted with excellence, this is an elegant presentation to your home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 White Buddha Lamp 5 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Lamp of Traditional Belief','Lamp of Traditional Belief','Lamp of Traditional Belief','Lamp of Traditional Belief'),(596,1,'Gift of Revitalization','&lt;p&gt;Crafted with excellence, this beautifully crafted meditation black and blue Buddha is perfectly designed for home dï¿½cor enthusiasts.This enchanting divine is sure to enhance the charm of your dï¿½cor and at the same time bring peace and prosperity in your life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Meditation Black &amp; Blue Buddha 11 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Gift of Revitalization','Gift of Revitalization','Gift of Revitalization','Gift of Revitalization'),(597,1,'Decorative Stunning Buddha','&lt;p&gt;With incredible detailed work and amazing artistry together combined to create this stunning black and golden buddha. The decorative standing showpiece paired with two fragrance candles, all decorated festively on wooden black tray must have showpiece for your home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Wooden Black Tray 11x5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Balck &amp; Golden Buddha height 5.5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Fragrance Candle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Decorative Stunning Buddha','Decorative Stunning Buddha','Decorative Stunning Buddha','Decorative Stunning Buddha'),(598,1,'Significance of Love And Meditation','&lt;p&gt;This sitting black and blue Buddha is believed to bring peace, prosperity and relaxation. Displaying him at home can definitely refresh your mind and bring calmness in you. Paired with golden ball candle, everything is placed on a brown flat tray in decorative way.This beautiful Buddha symbolizes divine protection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Brown Flat Tray 9x11&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Golden Ball Candle 2 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Meditation Black &amp; Blue Buddha 11 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Significance of Love And Meditation','Significance of Love And Meditation','Significance of Love And Meditation','Significance of Love And Meditation'),(599,1,'Evoking Sense of Peace','&lt;p&gt;Well crafted head of Lord Buddha is sure to bring love, wealth and prosperity all around where it is kept. Gift this idyllistic idol to bring peace in everyone\'s life. This idol is sure to evoke peace in life. There can\'t be better symbol of peace and prosperity than Buddha. Placed on wooden black tray, this idol is paired with two golden and black diya.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Buddha Head 7 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Wooden Black Tray 11x5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Golden &amp; Black Diya Diameter 1.5 inches','Evoking Sense of Peace','Evoking Sense of Peace','Evoking Sense of Peace','Evoking Sense of Peace'),(600,1,'Shrine of Positivity','&lt;p&gt;Garnish the ambience of your home with this welcome Buddha to give peaceful experience. This beautiful welcome Buddha is a wonderful gifting option for your close friend. It seems ideal to keep in your pooja room or in showcase. Let this beauty of shrine bring positivity in your life&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Welcome Buddha 9 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Shrine of Positivity','Shrine of Positivity','Shrine of Positivity','Shrine of Positivity'),(601,1,'Spirit of Festivity','&lt;p&gt;This unique kind of sculpture is best to bring divine peace in your home. Let peace and serenity float all around. Embellished with pearl candles, this welcome Buddha is an ideal gift for your loved ones or for great home and office dï¿½cor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Pearl Candle height 3 inches &amp; Diameter 3 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Welcome Buddha 9 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Spirit of Festivity','Spirit of Festivity','Spirit of Festivity','Spirit of Festivity'),(602,1,'Antique Meditating Buddha','&lt;p&gt;Add oodles of style to your home with meticulously crafted meditation black and blue Buddha with pearl candle, rose and lavender Poutpori, all embellished on a brown flat tray. This item is highly durable and makes perfect worth of your money.The amazing posture of Buddha will definitely bring peace to your home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Meditation Black &amp; Blue Buddha 11 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Pearl Candle height 3 inches &amp; Diameter 3 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Brown Flat Tray 9x11&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Lavender Poutpori&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Rose Poutpori&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Antique Meditating Buddha','Antique Meditating Buddha','Antique Meditating Buddha','Antique Meditating Buddha'),(603,1,'Personalized Colors of Celebration','&lt;p&gt;This lovely combo is a perfect memorable gift for birthdays. It includes a beautiful cushion with a happy birthday message, a greeting card, Cadbury Bournville Craneberry, a personalized white mug and elephant Feng-shui. This elegant gift is sure to make them feel pampered and loved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cushion 12x12&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Greeting Card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Bournville Cranberry 80gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Elephant Feng-shui&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 White Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Personalized Colors of Celebration','Personalized Colors of Celebration','Personalized Colors of Celebration','Personalized Colors of Celebration'),(604,1,'Chocolate For Love','&lt;p&gt;Love and laughter a bit of both is required for a happy life. So make your loved one happy with the amazing gift hamper of teddy bear along with 2 pieces of Cadbury Dairy milk chocolate 13 grams each.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pink Teddy Bear&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Cadbury Dairy milk chocolate 13 grams each&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Chocolate For Love','Chocolate For Love','Chocolate For Love','Chocolate For Love'),(605,1,'Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate Bouquet','A composition of 10 classic Dairy milk chocolate of 13 gm each with blue decorative garnishing in pink paper bouquet. It\'s a great gift for the chocolate lovers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please Note : As gift experts, we are committed to deliver a memorable experience on the day of the occasion. At times, gift may be delivered a day prior or a day after the chosen date.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;','Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate Bouquet','Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate Bouquet','Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate Bouquet','Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate Bouquet'),(606,1,'Chocolaty Vase','This Chocolaty Vase from Ferns N Petals is an ideal gift for anyone, be it a man or woman or young or adult. Gift this chocolaty hamper on birthdays, anniversaries, or any other day to make someone happy. This is a package of a 3 inches Green Tin Vase, decorated with a pink bow, having 6 Dairy Milk of 16.2 grams.','Chocolaty Vase','Chocolaty Vase','Chocolaty Vase','Chocolaty Vase'),(607,1,'Red Chocolates Potli','Celebrate the sweetness of your relation by gifting this special Red Chocolates Potli from Ferns N Petals. This is a beautiful Red &amp; Golden Velvet Potli Bag including 3 Cadbury Five Star Chocolates of 24grams each &amp; 3 Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolates of 17grams each.','Red Chocolates Potli','Red Chocolates Potli','Red Chocolates Potli','Red Chocolates Potli'),(608,1,'Pleasantly Pink','Pink denotes universal love. So, let this be the messenger of your love to the people whom you love the most with the gift of 7 Ferrero Rocher chocolates enwrapped within pink paper flower arrangement of pink and white colored wrapping paper in a form of a bouquet, tied with pink jute string bows. So tell your love your feeling with the utmost tenderness and sensitivity with the color that defines it the best.','Pleasantly Pink','Pleasantly Pink','Pleasantly Pink','Pleasantly Pink'),(609,1,'Pairfection','No birthday celebration is complete without chocolates. Send this celebrations pack along with a cute greeting card to your loved one. Your gift contain: greeting card, Cadbury Celebrations','Pairfection','Pairfection','Pairfection','Pairfection'),(610,1,'Happy Food Hamper','Appeal the inner child in all of us with a food hamper sure to delight our souls from Ferns N Petals. Get a hamper of 2 Lotte Choco Pie, 80 grams Cadbury Bourneville chocolates, 3 pieces of Ferrero Rocher, 50 grams gold coin chocolates, 2 Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates 18 grams each and 1 Nestle Munch beautifullyplaced in a hand made tray.','Happy Food Hamper','Happy Food Hamper','Happy Food Hamper','Happy Food Hamper'),(611,1,'Indulgent Chocolates','Amaze the chocolate lover with delicious chocolates ! Packed in a n elegant and sophisticated gift box are 250 grams of assorted chocolates. Each bite provides a rich, decadent bite of chocolate. It is a gift that your loved one will never forget.','Indulgent Chocolates','Indulgent Chocolates','Indulgent Chocolates','Indulgent Chocolates'),(612,1,'Starry Treat For All','Anyone who has looked a teddy bear in the face will recognize the friendly twinkle in his knowing look. So get your personal twinkles with this cute and fluffy 10 inch teddy bear along with 80 grams Cadbury Bourneville chocolate, 2 Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates,18 grams Nestle Kitkat chocolate and 24 grams Cadbury 5 Star chocolate 1 Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk 60gms beautifully placed in a wooden tray from Ferns N Petals.','Starry Treat For All','Starry Treat For All','Starry Treat For All','Starry Treat For All'),(613,1,'Choco Mania','Take a sweet break with your dear one with our tempting gift hamper of 20 Kitkat chocolates (18 grams each) decorated with artificial red berries and tied with red jute bows.','Choco Mania','Choco Mania','Choco Mania','Choco Mania'),(614,1,'Delicious Rochers','&lt;p&gt;Chocolates equal to smiles, that is the simplest mathematical equation you will ever learn. Bring smiles of the faces of your loved ones by sending them this pack of 16 De Miami Rochers. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De Miami Rocher 210gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Delicious Rochers','Delicious Rochers','Delicious Rochers','Delicious Rochers'),(615,1,'Munchies For You','Bring out the child in you with this goodie tray from Ferns N Petals. Get a beautiful hamper of 6 inches teddy bear along with 2 Twix chocolates 50 grams, 21 grams Mars chocolates, 1 Lotte Choco Pie, 20 grams Cadbury Gems, 21 Nestle Kitkat, 18 grams Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates beautifully placed in a hand made tray from Ferns N Petals.','Munchies For You','Munchies For You','Munchies For You','Munchies For You'),(616,1,'Easter Fun For Little Ones','More than just chocolate - this fun filled hamper will entertain as well. With the the amazing toys of Kinder Joy, their fun and merriment will double with Ferns N Petals. So without further delay, get this hamper that includes 2 Kinder Joy chocolates along with Galaxy Crispy and Galaxy Caramel chocolates 36 grams each, Galaxy Fruit &amp; Nuts and Galaxy Smooth Milk 43 grams each and 2 Lotte Choco Pie in a jute basket with 1 FNP Easter special greeting card for your little ones and make their easter celebration be filled with sweetness all around.','Easter Fun For Little Ones','Easter Fun For Little Ones','Easter Fun For Little Ones','Easter Fun For Little Ones'),(617,1,'100 Reasons of Love n Chocolates','&lt;p&gt;Touch their heart in the most special and sweet way. Give them not 1 or 2 but 100 reason of why you love them. Make this Valentine\'s Day sweeter with these delicious chocolates. Let your love outshine everything with these valentine gifts.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 50 grams of heart assorted chocolates.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One 100 reason why I love you booklet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;To find someone who will love you for no reason, and to shower that person with reasons, that is the ultimate happiness.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','100 Reasons of Love n Chocolates','100 Reasons of Love n Chocolates','100 Reasons of Love n Chocolates','100 Reasons of Love n Chocolates'),(618,1,'Lolipop Bouquet','Candies are the natures way of making up for Mondays. So make your mondays brighter with this one of a kind Lolipop bouquet of 7 lolipops decorated beautifully with fine net from Ferns N Petals and say goodbye to your Monday blues.','Lolipop Bouquet','Lolipop Bouquet','Lolipop Bouquet','Lolipop Bouquet'),(619,1,'It could be Chocolate Love','There is no right time to celebrate love. Make your beloved rejoice your love with a small token of love from Ferns N Petals. Get a gift hamper of 20 Cadbury Eclairs toffees, 1 piece red ball candle and 2 Cadbury Dairymilk chocolate 18 grams each beautifully placed in a wooden tray and a .','It could be Chocolate Love','It could be Chocolate Love','It could be Chocolate Love','It could be Chocolate Love'),(620,1,'World Of Lovely Chocolates Hamper','Get a beautiful gift hamper to celebrate your love with Ferns N Petals. Gift your love a gift hamper of 2 inch teddy, 18 grams Nestle Kitkat, 2 Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates 18 grams each, 17 grams Cadbury Perk, 24 grams Cadbury 5 Star, 17 grams Cadbury Perk and 1 round candle in basket. Ideal gift for occasions like Valentine\'s Day.','World Of Lovely Chocolates Hamper','World Of Lovely Chocolates Hamper','World Of Lovely Chocolates Hamper','World Of Lovely Chocolates Hamper'),(621,1,'Love Rules Hamper','When you love someone, all your saved up wishes start coming out. So make every wish of your beloved come true with Ferns N Petals. Gift her/him a small love basket of 2 teddy holding hearts key chains along with 1 Cadbury Dairymilk chocolate 17 grams each and 22 Cadbury Eclairs toffees. Make her feel special with this small token of love.','Love Rules Hamper','Love Rules Hamper','Love Rules Hamper','Love Rules Hamper'),(622,1,'A Chocolaty Vase With Candles','This Chocolaty Vase from Ferns N Petals is an ideal gift for anyone, be it a man or woman or young or adult. Gift this chocolaty hamper on birthdays, anniversaries, or any other day to make someone happy. This is a package of 2 Golden Ball Candles, one 3 inches Green Tin Vase, decorated with a pink bow, having 6 Dairy Milk of 16.2 grams.','A Chocolaty Vase With Candles','A Chocolaty Vase With Candles','A Chocolaty Vase With Candles','A Chocolaty Vase With Candles'),(623,1,'Golden Tray With Chocolates','Golden Tray With Chocolates\' Combo is a true delight for all the chocolate-lovers out there. This combo encompasses of One Golden Embellished Tray, filled with 10 chocolates, namely 4 Nestle Classic of 18 grams each, 1 Mars of 30 grams, One Dairy Milk Fruit &amp; Nut of 42 grams, 2 Dairy Milk of 16.2 grams each, 1 Twix 50 grams and 1 Cadbury 5-Star of 24 grams.','Golden Tray With Chocolates','Golden Tray With Chocolates','Golden Tray With Chocolates','Golden Tray With Chocolates'),(624,1,'My Heart Chocolates','&lt;p&gt;Take the help of chocolates to pop your special question on this valentine\'s day. Placed in your heart box are these delicious desserts which are to be relished slowly- bite by decadent bite.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 350 grams of assorted chocolates in a heart shaped box.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;To love someone is nothing, to be loved by someone is something, but to be loved by the one you love is everything.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','My Heart Chocolates','My Heart Chocolates','My Heart Chocolates','My Heart Chocolates'),(625,1,'Joyous Celebration','&lt;p&gt;This gift hamper is sure to make your beloved\'s day. This sweet and tempting chocolate like cadbury dairy milk chocolate, lotte choco pie arranged in a boat shaped wooden basket is the perfect way to present branded chocolates in dear ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Boat Shape Wooden Basket 9X6.50&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate 13gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Lotte Choco Pie 168gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Joyous Celebration','Joyous Celebration','Joyous Celebration','Joyous Celebration'),(626,1,'Sweetening your Tastebuds','&lt;p&gt;Send greatest birthday wish ever with this delicious chocolate. Coated with fun and topped with Happy Birthday message, this chocolate is perfect choice to say &quot;Happy Birthday&quot; to someone special.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Happy Birthday Chocolate 45gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sweetening your Tastebuds','Sweetening your Tastebuds','Sweetening your Tastebuds','Sweetening your Tastebuds'),(627,1,'Feel Good With Love','When you love someone, all your saved up wishes start coming out. So make every wish of your beloved come true with Ferns N Petals. Gift her/him a small love basket of 2 teddy holding hearts key chains 2 inches each along with 1 red round candle and 20 Cadbury Eclairs toffees. Make her feel special with this small token of love.','Feel Good With Love','Feel Good With Love','Feel Good With Love','Feel Good With Love'),(628,1,'Big Red Heart','Chocolates are always appreciated and loved by everyone. Send this big heart filled with assorted chcocolates to your loved one. The greeting card ensures remembrance. Your gift contain:Happy Birthday Greeting Card, Chocolate Box In Heart Shape, Assorted Chocolate','Big Red Heart','Big Red Heart','Big Red Heart','Big Red Heart'),(629,1,'A Sweet Treasure For Moms','Don\'t let this Mother\'s Day pass away like any regular day, because it\'s the day dedicated to the journey of being a mother. Celebrate this special occasion by sending \'A Sweet Treasure For Mom\' to your mummy through Ferns N Petals. Gift contains: 100 reasons why you\'re the best mom 5 Dairy Milk chocolates','A Sweet Treasure For Moms','A Sweet Treasure For Moms','A Sweet Treasure For Moms','A Sweet Treasure For Moms'),(630,1,'Message For Mom','Let your Super Mommy know how your life would not have been the same if she was not there guide you forever . Make the day special for her with a small token of love in the form of 160 grams chocolate box with Love You Mommy written on them in white chocolate along with FNP Mother\'s Day special greeting card from Ferns N Petals.','Message For Mom','Message For Mom','Message For Mom','Message For Mom'),(631,1,'Gloriette Choco Swiss','&lt;p&gt;Get an exquisite selection of Swiss chocolates for your loved one. With a new exotic flavor in every bite, this chocolate box is sure to delight chocoholics. It\'s a delicious way to give your loved one a true chocolaty experience.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 100 grams of Gloriette Choco Swiss chocolate box.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Love is a song that never ends.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Gloriette Choco Swiss','Gloriette Choco Swiss','Gloriette Choco Swiss','Gloriette Choco Swiss'),(632,1,'Cadbury Celebrations Box','Chocolates are one of the most loved sweets, exchanged on several occasions and even without any occasion. Knowing this, Ferns N Petals has come up with One 119 grams Blue Box of Cadbury Celebrations to add a pinch of sweetness to your happiness.','Cadbury Celebrations Box','Cadbury Celebrations Box','Cadbury Celebrations Box','Cadbury Celebrations Box'),(633,1,'Little Luck With Bamboo','&lt;p&gt;Bring a little luck into the home of your loved ones with this five stick bamboo plant. This plant is a wonderful gift plant that adds a bold statement to indoor décor with its intricately arranged stems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Five Stick Bamboo Approx. 5 Inches&lt;br/&gt;Light Brown Ceramic Kulhar Shaped Vase with Plate 2.5 inches&lt;/p&gt;','Little Luck With Bamboo','Little Luck With Bamboo','Little Luck With Bamboo','Little Luck With Bamboo'),(634,1,'Flavourful Experience Guaranteed','A treat that guarantees praises! Get this amazing hamper of Dukes Waffy in Chocolate and Pineapple flavour wafers 75 grams each, Tetley Masala Tea and Elaichi Tea 12 tea bags each, 200 grams Gaia Multi Grain Cookies, 36 grams Galaxy Crispy chocolate and Galaxy Fruits &amp; Nuts chocolates, Galaxy Smooth Milk chocolate 43 grams each and a black ceramic coffee mug nicely placed in a basket from Ferns N Petals.','Flavourful Experience Guaranteed','Flavourful Experience Guaranteed','Flavourful Experience Guaranteed','Flavourful Experience Guaranteed'),(635,1,'Entrancing Delight','&lt;p&gt;A source of inspiration, charm and glory of the Family, a daughter is the one who takes the best care of everyone. Make this day much more special for your daughter by presenting her this splendid combination of chocolates, a pocket mirror and a lovely greeting card.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Small Heart Shape Pocket Mirror&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Greeting Card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chokola Very Nutty Dark Mendiants 80gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Entrancing Delight','Entrancing Delight','Entrancing Delight','Entrancing Delight'),(636,1,'Chocolaty Surprise','&lt;p&gt;The love for chocolates can never die, so why not to present something as such. Gift your loved ones with this premium set of mouth watering Truffles and let them know they are special.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiTruffles set of Nine&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Chocolaty Surprise','Chocolaty Surprise','Chocolaty Surprise','Chocolaty Surprise'),(637,1,'Special Treat for Chocolate Lovers','&lt;p&gt;No one can ever say no to the smooth and buttery taste of the fudges. Delight your relatives and friends by surprising them with this offered box of De Miami Fudge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiFudge set of Six&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Special Treat for Chocolate Lovers','Special Treat for Chocolate Lovers','Special Treat for Chocolate Lovers','Special Treat for Chocolate Lovers'),(638,1,'Irresistable Delight','&lt;p&gt;Sweet delight of Choco Swiss has always found its way directly into people\'s heart. Symbolizing love, affection and pleasure, it is perfect for any occasions or festivals. No other food item is more admirable than this chocolate. Gift this sweet love to your loved ones and bring cheers on their face. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Choco Swiss Jingles 100gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Irresistable Delight','Irresistable Delight','Irresistable Delight','Irresistable Delight'),(639,1,'A Chocolaty Thank You','&lt;p&gt;What a wonderful way of thanking your someone special. This Thank You chocolate bar is perfect to make feel your loved ones special and a right way to wish them for what they have done.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Thank you Chocolate 45gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','A Chocolaty Thank You','A Chocolaty Thank You','A Chocolaty Thank You','A Chocolaty Thank You'),(640,1,'Diwali Elegance','&lt;p&gt;Elegance is what reflects beautifully form the offered box of Assorted Chocolates. These De Miami Assorted Chocolates will serve the purpose of expressing your care, love and concern towards your family and friends.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 12 pcs. Red Ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Diwali Elegance','Diwali Elegance','Diwali Elegance','Diwali Elegance'),(641,1,'Sugary Dreams','&lt;p&gt;Diwali marks the homecoming of Lord Rama after 14 long years in the forests. For celebrating such an auspicious day, gift your friends and family with the most loved sweets and chocolates that are brought forward to you by Ferns N Petals in the form of a combo. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 12 pcs. Red Ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Haldiram Soan Papdi 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sugary Dreams','Sugary Dreams','Sugary Dreams','Sugary Dreams'),(642,1,'The Azure','&lt;p&gt;The grace of this box of Assorted Chocolates is enough to convey your subtle message of joys, celebrations, love and care to your loved ones. So, why not to present the offered Assorted De Miami Chocolates to them this Diwali and make it memorable. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 12 pcs. Blue Ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The Azure','The Azure','The Azure','The Azure'),(643,1,'Tempting Attraction','&lt;p&gt;While you are planning for gifting something special and delicious to your loved ones, Ferns N Petals brings forth this delicious treat for the taste buds. The offered combo of goodies will not only be a lip smacking treat, but also a sweet surprise for them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 18 pcs.(horizontal box)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bikano Soan Papdi 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Tempting Attraction','Tempting Attraction','Tempting Attraction','Tempting Attraction'),(644,1,'Alluring Hue of Blue','&lt;p&gt;If happiness and joys could be delivered in a basket, then this is the exact personification of it. A basket full of delicious Cookies, Assorted Chocolates and much more is all you need to gift your dear ones to wish them \'Happy Diwali\' in the most beautiful way. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 12 pcs. Blue Ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bikano Cornflakes Mixture 200gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chokola Choco Chip Cookies 185gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Almonds 100gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Colorful Tin Box 3x3 inches &amp; 3.5 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wooden Basket diameter 9 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Alluring Hue of Blue','Alluring Hue of Blue','Alluring Hue of Blue','Alluring Hue of Blue'),(645,1,'Lip Smacking Delight','&lt;p&gt;Personification of perfection is what this alluring combo of tempting goodies boasts. Bringing smiles on the faces of your loved ones, this combo will bring them a delightful treat of Assorted Chocolates, Cookies and Namkeen, beautifully placed in a Floral Golden Tray. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Golden Square colorful Floral Tray 11X11&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 12 pcs. Red Ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bikano Multi Grain Cookies 150gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bikano Khatta Meetha 200gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Lip Smacking Delight','Lip Smacking Delight','Lip Smacking Delight','Lip Smacking Delight'),(646,1,'Facets of Romance','&lt;p&gt;Be it great housewarming gifts or lovely holiday gifts, this exclusive combo makes a worthwhile gift. It includes scented candle in red glass pot with choco swiss jingles. This scintillating fragrances is sure to blow away your mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Scented Candle in Red Glass Pot height 5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Choco Swiss Jingles 100gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Facets of Romance','Facets of Romance','Facets of Romance','Facets of Romance'),(647,1,'Choco Delicio','&lt;p&gt;A yummy chocolate basket for your dear ones! So, if you are confused to gift something special to someone special, then, this basket of assorted chocolate is your perfect choice. It includes bounty, cadbury bournville craneberry, twix and cadbury temptations. It is perfect to gift someone whom you want to express your feelings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Round Wooden Basket 9 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Bounty 57gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Bournville Cranberry 80gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Twix 50gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Temptations Rum Raisins 72gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Cadbury Temptations Almond Treat 72gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Temptations Cashew Appeal 72gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Choco Delicio','Choco Delicio','Choco Delicio','Choco Delicio'),(648,1,'Cadbury Carnival','&lt;p&gt;This gift hamper is perfect for chocolate lovers delight. With wide assorted chocolates arranged decoratively in a round wooden basket account for an extravagant taste to your tongue. Simply charm your loved ones with this delightful basket.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Round Wooden Basket 9 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Lotte Choco Pie 168gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Bournville Cranberry 80gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolate 13gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Temptations Rum Raisins 72gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cadbury Temptations Almond Treat 72gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Cadbury Temptations Cashew Appeal 72gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Cadbury Carnival','Cadbury Carnival','Cadbury Carnival','Cadbury Carnival'),(649,1,'Soothing Hamper','&lt;p&gt;Nothing would be a perfect gift for any festive occasion than this gift hamper. It includes red and golden ball candles with assorted chocolates packed in a wooden box embellished with red ribbon. This hamper is a best buy for any occasion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Golden Ball Candle 2 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Red Ball Candle 2 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Assorted Chocolate 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Wooden Box Five portion 10x6 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Red Ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Soothing Hamper','Soothing Hamper','Soothing Hamper','Soothing Hamper'),(650,1,'Happy Birthday Cushion','This is a perfect gift for special someone who deserves all your love and happiness. This is a White 12X12 inches Cushion with message, \'Happy Birthday\', printed on it.','Happy Birthday Cushion','Happy Birthday Cushion','Happy Birthday Cushion','Happy Birthday Cushion'),(651,1,'Pink Birthday Cushion','Make the mood of your dear one his or her birthday, through this comforting gift. This is a Pink 12X12 inches Cushion with message, \'Happy Birthday\', printed on it.','Pink Birthday Cushion','Pink Birthday Cushion','Pink Birthday Cushion','Pink Birthday Cushion'),(652,1,'Red Hug','Since your loved one has made your life so special simply by being there with you always, there can nothing be as amazing as there presence in your life. Express what you have not said for a long time and send this Red Hug cushion and let them feel your unspoken words silently! Your gift contain: 12x12 Red Hug Cushion','Red Hug','Red Hug','Red Hug','Red Hug'),(653,1,'Falling In Love Cushion','Love is in the air. Convey your heartfelt desires and love to your beloved with this breathtakingly beautiful cushion. Stir up your love with this cute, lovely cushion which says Let\'s fall in love together','Falling In Love Cushion','Falling In Love Cushion','Falling In Love Cushion','Falling In Love Cushion'),(654,1,'Cute Teddy With Message Cushion','May your love comfort your beloved with this cute teddy printed cushion (12x12 inches) with a love message for your loved one.','Cute Teddy With Message Cushion','Cute Teddy With Message Cushion','Cute Teddy With Message Cushion','Cute Teddy With Message Cushion'),(655,1,'Love Couple Cushion','&lt;p&gt;This is the season of love. Express what you feel with a romantic set of two cushions. Perfect Valentine gift, your beloved can adorn their house or simply cuddle them remembering you. This Valentine\'s Day, stir up the love with these cute cushions which says- I will love you till the day after forever.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Two 12x12 inches love cushions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;I can conquer the world with one hand as long as you are holding the other.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Couple Cushion','Love Couple Cushion','Love Couple Cushion','Love Couple Cushion'),(656,1,'Greetings for the Birthday','&lt;p&gt;Gifts and blessings are the integral and obvious part of the birthdays. Why not to add both of them and present as one, in the form of this lovely Cushion with a sweet message printed on it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Pink Non personalized Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Greetings for the Birthday','Greetings for the Birthday','Greetings for the Birthday','Greetings for the Birthday'),(657,1,'Why God Made Brothers Cushion','Let your brother remember you every time he seeks comfort through a soft cushion, by sending across this high-quality Cushion. This is a 12X12 inches sized Cushion with a lovely message printed on it.','Why God Made Brothers Cushion','Why God Made Brothers Cushion','Why God Made Brothers Cushion','Why God Made Brothers Cushion'),(658,1,'Hug Me Cushion','For the couple who love each other so much, they cannot let each other go. Spice up your room with a couple cushion which says I want to be in your arms, where you hold me tight and never let me go. Convey your heartfelt desires and love to your beloved with this breathtakingly beautiful cushion. Brings joy to everyday life.','Hug Me Cushion','Hug Me Cushion','Hug Me Cushion','Hug Me Cushion'),(659,1,'Soft Pink Sister Cushion','Let your sister remember you every time she seeks comfort through a soft cushion, by sending across this high-quality Cushion. This is a 12X12 inches sized Pink Cushion with a quotation \'No. 1 Sister\'.','Soft Pink Sister Cushion','Soft Pink Sister Cushion','Soft Pink Sister Cushion','Soft Pink Sister Cushion'),(660,1,'Yellow and Mellow Celebrations','&lt;p&gt;Birthdays are meant to be celebrated, to celebrate the completion of one successful and happy year of life. Add joys to such celebrations by giving this lovely Cushion as the birthday present.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Yellow and White Color Non personalized Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Yellow and Mellow Celebrations','Yellow and Mellow Celebrations','Yellow and Mellow Celebrations','Yellow and Mellow Celebrations'),(661,1,'Miss You','Red stands for love , passion and romance. Let your loved one know how much you miss him/her. Send this cute cushion and make him/her feel so much more special. Your gift contain: A 12x12 Miss You Cushion.','Miss You','Miss You','Miss You','Miss You'),(662,1,'Modesty of the Virgo','&lt;p&gt;For the best advices given by the people of Virgo sun sign in your life, thank them in a unique way. Gift them with this specialized Cushion made for them that quotes their best qualities of observance, modesty and so on. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sea Green Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Modesty of the Virgo','Modesty of the Virgo','Modesty of the Virgo','Modesty of the Virgo'),(663,1,'Romantic Cushion','Add a touch of your love to the home interior. Emanate your love in a charming and elegant way. Spice up your love life with a wonderful couple cushion which reads I want you for always..days..years.. and all eternity','Romantic Cushion','Romantic Cushion','Romantic Cushion','Romantic Cushion'),(664,1,'Special Mom Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Mom is always special. She knows you, understands you and loves you beyond everything. Convey your feelings to her with this fabulous cushion. What a gift!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch cushion for mother.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;ldquo;The heart of a mother is a deep abyss at the bottom of which you will always find forgiveness.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Special Mom Cushion','Special Mom Cushion','Special Mom Cushion','Special Mom Cushion'),(665,1,'Worlds Best Mom Cushion','Let the world know you have got one in a million mother and that you love her beyond any defined boundaries. Surprise your Super Mom with this amazing 12x12 inches mother special cushion from Ferns N Petals.','Worlds Best Mom Cushion','Worlds Best Mom Cushion','Worlds Best Mom Cushion','Worlds Best Mom Cushion'),(666,1,'Awesome Doctor Cushion','Celebrate the awesomeness of your Doctor by sending across this pillow which says so on an occasion like Doctors Day. Your gift contains one cushion','Awesome Doctor Cushion','Awesome Doctor Cushion','Awesome Doctor Cushion','Awesome Doctor Cushion'),(667,1,'Daddys Princess','&lt;p&gt;No matter how old a girl gets, she will always remain her Daddy\'s Little Princess. Pamper her a bit more by presenting her this beautiful Pillow Cover that quotes Reserved for My Princess. Conveying your unconditional love to her, this gift will make her feel special, the way she is.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One White Pillow Cover 22x17 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Daddys Princess','Daddys Princess','Daddys Princess','Daddys Princess'),(668,1,'Special Katty Cushion','A birthday is the special in everyone\'s life which they need to be special. Make sure you turn a regular birthday into a special one. h Send this greeting card and cushion and surprise them on their special day. Your gift contain: greeting card, Cat Cusion','Special Katty Cushion','Special Katty Cushion','Special Katty Cushion','Special Katty Cushion'),(669,1,'Bubbly Blue Cushion','There is only one happiness in life, to love and to be loved. So make it a happy day for your sweetheart with this one of a kind 12x12 inches blue bird printed cushion from Ferns N Petals and let your beloved know how much they mean to you.','Bubbly Blue Cushion','Bubbly Blue Cushion','Bubbly Blue Cushion','Bubbly Blue Cushion'),(670,1,'Mom you are my world cushion','Love for your Mom is limitless and to count it on your finger is useless. Send her this lovely cushion with a love quote to make her feel that your love for her is as wide 