Libra'),(675,1,'Comfort Dad With Your Love','A dad is someone who wants to catch you before you fall but instead picks you up, brushes you off, and lets you try again. So let your father know what he means to you on this Fathers Day. Get this amazing 12x12 inches father special printed cushion from Ferns N Petals and comfort him with your love and affection.','Comfort Dad With Your Love','Comfort Dad With Your Love','Comfort Dad With Your Love','Comfort Dad With Your Love'),(676,1,'Red For Love Cushion','Birds have always been the messenger of love from time immemorable. So let us make them your love messenger. Get an amazing love proclaiming gift of 12x12 inches bird printed red love cushion from Ferns N Petals and let your beloved know how important they are for you.','Red For Love Cushion','Red For Love Cushion','Red For Love Cushion','Red For Love Cushion'),(677,1,'Loving Birds Couple Cushions','Love is the bridge between two hearts. So bridge all the gaps and let your beloved know how important they are for you with this cute pair of 12x12 inches cute love bird printed red couple cushions from Ferns N Petals.','Loving Birds Couple Cushions','Loving Birds Couple Cushions','Loving Birds Couple Cushions','Loving Birds Couple Cushions'),(678,1,'Cheetah in the House Cushion','Make one the ferocious beast of the feline family add glamour to your home decor. Get 12x12 inches cheetah printed black cushion with Ferns N Petals and get a powerful visual effect to your home decor.','Cheetah in the House Cushion','Cheetah in the House Cushion','Cheetah in the House Cushion','Cheetah in the House Cushion'),(679,1,'Dad You R Amazing','A father\'s lap is the most relaxing place for a kid. Why not amaze him by sending your dad this vibrant cushion and comfort him with your never ending love and care for him. Your Gift contains: Dad cushion','Dad You R Amazing','Dad You R Amazing','Dad You R Amazing','Dad You R Amazing'),(680,1,'Cushion With A Message For Sister','Tell your sister that how much you love her by presenting this special surprise to her. This is a 12X12 inches soft and colorfast Cushion with a message, \'I am so lucky to have a sister like you\', printed on it.','Cushion With A Message For Sister','Cushion With A Message For Sister','Cushion With A Message For Sister','Cushion With A Message For Sister'),(681,1,'Cushion For Sister','Make your sister feel special as always, by presenting her this soft and colorfast cushion. This is a 12X12 inches sized Cushion with a quote \'Sister you are one in a million\', ideal for Rakhi, birthday, Bhai Dooj, etc.|','Cushion For Sister','Cushion For Sister','Cushion For Sister','Cushion For Sister'),(682,1,'Meri Pyari Maa Cushion','Love Anger Happy Hurt Sad Elated .. many emotions, one name in mind, MAA. So let your sweetest mother know that your life would not have been the same without her with this amazing 12x12 inches mother special cushion from Ferns N Petals. This cushion is unique why? Because you can get the quote printed in your regional language.Send us your regional language to be used on the cushion, along with your order number, to image@myfnp.com. Please send it right after placing the order to any delay in the delivery.','Meri Pyari Maa Cushion','Meri Pyari Maa Cushion','Meri Pyari Maa Cushion','Meri Pyari Maa Cushion'),(683,1,'Super Special Gift For Dad','A father give the greatest gift that can be given ever, the gift of belief in his children. So your love and affection for your Dad and let him know how much he means for you with this super special 12x12 inches father special printed cushion from Ferns N Petals.','Super Special Gift For Dad','Super Special Gift For Dad','Super Special Gift For Dad','Super Special Gift For Dad'),(684,1,'Grandmothers Cushion','The way your Grand Mother hsa always cared for you and loved you,present a small token of thanks and respect by gifting her this exquisite White Printed Cushion of 12X12 inches, with a beaautiful message printed on it.','Grandmothers Cushion','Grandmothers Cushion','Grandmothers Cushion','Grandmothers Cushion'),(685,1,'Special Daughters Cushion','Let Your Daughter Know How Proud You Are To Have Her In Your Life. Convey Your Message Through Our Special 12X12\'\' Daughter\'s Cushion And Make Her Day.','Special Daughters Cushion','Special Daughters Cushion','Special Daughters Cushion','Special Daughters Cushion'),(686,1,'Happy Couple Cushion','Love is a symbol of eternity. It wipes out all sense of time, destroying all memory of a beginning and all fear of an end. So express your love with this 12x12 inches cute couple printed cushion from Ferns N Petals.','Happy Couple Cushion','Happy Couple Cushion','Happy Couple Cushion','Happy Couple Cushion'),(687,1,'Mr &amp; Mrs Right Cushions','Special attention to all the couples who have accepted each other beautifully. For all the men who have surrendered to the will of their ladies. To all the ladies who know their word is the final decision, we present an ultimate pair of 12x12 inches funny couple cushion from Ferns N Petals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please Note : As gift experts, we are committed to deliver a memorable experience on the day of the occasion. At times, gift may be delivered a day prior or a day after the chosen date.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; Price includes Rs. 200 as shipping charges.','Mr &amp; Mrs Right Cushions','Mr &amp; Mrs Right Cushions','Mr &amp; Mrs Right Cushions','Mr &amp; Mrs Right Cushions'),(688,1,'Always Kiss Me Cushions','&lt;p&gt;Kiss is the shortest and easiest way to bring two hearts together. Don\'t let a moment go by without kissing your sweetheart. When words are not enough, kisses do the talking. Let your love know they are on your mind all the time with these passionate kiss cushions.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Two 12x12 inch kiss cushions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;The best kiss is the one that has been exchanged a thousand time between the eyes before it reaches the lips.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Always Kiss Me Cushions','Always Kiss Me Cushions','Always Kiss Me Cushions','Always Kiss Me Cushions'),(689,1,'Kiss Me Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Travel the distance between your heart to their\'s with the sweetest kiss ever made. Give your beloved a timeless sensation of pure love and pleasure with this beautiful Kiss Me Cushion.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch kiss cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;A kiss makes the heart young again and wipes out the years.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Kiss Me Cushion','Kiss Me Cushion','Kiss Me Cushion','Kiss Me Cushion'),(690,1,'Make You Mine Cushion','&lt;p&gt;In this season of love, warm your loved one\'s heart with the charming sentiment that graces this cozy cushion. Make the love of your life yours forever with this perfect valentine gift. This cushion declares your love and stirs up your love life.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch make you mine cushions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Love me and the world is mine.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Make You Mine Cushion','Make You Mine Cushion','Make You Mine Cushion','Make You Mine Cushion'),(691,1,'In Love Cushion','&lt;p&gt;In this season of love express what you feel with a romantic love cushion. Bring a little romance into the living room and show your beloved how much you love them. Perfect valentine gift, your beloved can adorn their house or simply cuddle them remembering you.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch love cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;I can conquer the world with one hand as long as you are holding the other.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','In Love Cushion','In Love Cushion','In Love Cushion','In Love Cushion'),(692,1,'My Love Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Perfect valentine gift for the couple who love each other so much, they cannot let each other go. Spice up your room and life with this My Love Cushion. Ignite love in the Valentine celebration with this breathtakingly beautiful cushion.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch love cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Love is of all passions the strongest, for it attacks simultaneously the head, the heart, and the senses.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','My Love Cushion','My Love Cushion','My Love Cushion','My Love Cushion'),(693,1,'Kiss For Lifetime Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Spoil the one you love with a lovely and touching gift. There is nothing more enjoyable than curling up against a comfy cushion which says- If my love for you is measured through kisses, I would be kissing you for a lifetime. A perfect romantic gift for your special someone.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch kiss cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;The soul that can speak with its eyes can also kiss with a gaze.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Kiss For Lifetime Cushion','Kiss For Lifetime Cushion','Kiss For Lifetime Cushion','Kiss For Lifetime Cushion'),(694,1,'Always n Forever Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Express what you feel with a romantic cushion. It makes such a lovely romantic gesture that will remind your beloved just how much you love them. Yyour beloved can adorn their house or simply cuddle them remembering you. Enjoy the beauty of this valentine gift and spread romance.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch always &amp; forever cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;True love stories never have endings.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Always n Forever Cushion','Always n Forever Cushion','Always n Forever Cushion','Always n Forever Cushion'),(695,1,'I Love You Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Sometimes the little things mean just as much as a grand gestures. Transform your living room into the perfect romantic setting with this I Love You Cushion. This valentine gift expresses what is there in your heart and takes your partner on a romantic ride.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch I love you cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Only from the heart can you touch the sky.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','I Love You Cushion','I Love You Cushion','I Love You Cushion','I Love You Cushion'),(696,1,'Love n Friendship Cushion','&lt;p&gt;When your relationship is more than just love, it becomes truly special. Celebrate this crazy, cheerful, bestest relationship this Valentine\'s Day with this Love &amp; Friendship Cushion. It defines your love just in the perfect way.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Can miles truly separate you from friends. If you want to be with someone you love, arent you already there?&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love n Friendship Cushion','Love n Friendship Cushion','Love n Friendship Cushion','Love n Friendship Cushion'),(697,1,'Cute Hug Me Cushion','&lt;p&gt;Let love prevail in this season of romance. Send your sweetheart piles of hugs and kisses. Gift them this cute hug cushion and declare your love loud and clear.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch hug cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;I like hugs. I really like long hugs, the ones where you just don\'t want to let go.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Cute Hug Me Cushion','Cute Hug Me Cushion','Cute Hug Me Cushion','Cute Hug Me Cushion'),(698,1,'Awesomeness Redefined','There can never be enough of gratitude towards your doctor. He always make sure about our well being and good health. Your Gift Contains:','Awesomeness Redefined','Awesomeness Redefined','Awesomeness Redefined','Awesomeness Redefined'),(699,1,'Love and Comfort','&lt;p&gt;The beauty of your feelings towards your daughter can be best expressed through a gift that conveys your message gracefully. For such, Ferns N Petals has exclusively designed an elegant cushion which quotes To the World\'s Best DaughterA€¦ You\'re the Most Beautiful Gift anyone has ever been gifted with. Gift this exquisite cushion to her this Daughter\'s Day and let her feel your unconditional love.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One 12x12 inches Printed Beige and White Cushion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Love and Comfort','Love and Comfort','Love and Comfort','Love and Comfort'),(700,1,'Blessed Happiness','&lt;p&gt;Tell your daughter how much you love her by presenting this beautiful Pink colored Cushion with the message The Best Thing in the World is Seeing My Daughter Happy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink Colored 12x12 inch Cushion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Blessed Happiness','Blessed Happiness','Blessed Happiness','Blessed Happiness'),(701,1,'Personalized cherishable Memory','&lt;p&gt;A girl always remains a princess, whether the princess of her dreams or her Daddy\'s. Present her this alluring Personalized Pillow Cover and tag her as the princess, the way she is!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Color Personalized Pillow cover 22x17 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Personalized cherishable Memory','Personalized cherishable Memory','Personalized cherishable Memory','Personalized cherishable Memory'),(702,1,'Builder of The Empire','&lt;p&gt;Your boss has built the empire, being the most supportive pillar of the organization. Present your token of gratitude to his efforts in a gracious manner by presenting him/her this elegant Cushion that reads Building the Empire. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Black Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Builder of The Empire','Builder of The Empire','Builder of The Empire','Builder of The Empire'),(703,1,'King of the Game','&lt;p&gt;There is no \'I\' in the team, your boss is the one who not only reigns the empire, but also lends his hand to support whenever needed. Being grateful to all the support, gift him/her this amazing Cushion on this Boss Day that reads, You are the Boss that supports like a Leader and rules like a King. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beige Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','King of the Game','King of the Game','King of the Game','King of the Game'),(704,1,'The Leader','&lt;p&gt;The leader is the one who not only reaches the top himself, but help the others to reach there as well. While your boss possess this quality of reaching out for others and letting them to be on the top, surprise him/her with this motivating Cushion that reads Keep Calm and Lead On &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Electric Blue Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The Leader','The Leader','The Leader','The Leader'),(705,1,'Valor of the Scorpio','&lt;p&gt;Celebrate the presence of the most focused, brave and balanced people in your life by presenting them this amazing Cushion of their sun sign. This Cushion comes with their most amazing qualities listed onto it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Peach Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Valor of the Scorpio','Valor of the Scorpio','Valor of the Scorpio','Valor of the Scorpio'),(706,1,'Honesty of the Sagittarius','&lt;p&gt;The optimism, intelligence and honesty of the Sagittarius people are worth appreciating. While you are supported by such people in your life. Gift them with this special Sagittarius Cushion designed for their sun sign.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Violet Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Honesty of the Sagittarius','Honesty of the Sagittarius','Honesty of the Sagittarius','Honesty of the Sagittarius'),(707,1,'Wisdom of the Capricorn','&lt;p&gt;All for the practical and wise nature of the Capricorn people in your life; present this gracious Cushion to them that beautifully portrays their best of qualities. Receiving such a gift will make their day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beige Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Wisdom of the Capricorn','Wisdom of the Capricorn','Wisdom of the Capricorn','Wisdom of the Capricorn'),(708,1,'Ace of the Hearts','&lt;p&gt;This is one of a kind Cushion that is not only perfect for the people who love to deal, but also for your loved ones as they are the ace of hearts for you. Surprise them with this beautiful Cushion and make their day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One 12x12 inches Cushion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Ace of the Hearts','Ace of the Hearts','Ace of the Hearts','Ace of the Hearts'),(709,1,'Forever Together','&lt;p&gt;Brighten up any room with this love filled cushion. Let your dear ones blush with smile on receiving this incredibly beautiful Love cushion. It is a perfect way to show how much you care for them and letting them to cuddle up with something reminding of you when you are not around them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Forever Together','Forever Together','Forever Together','Forever Together'),(710,1,'Forever Always Special','&lt;p&gt;Everyday, she loves you in her onw special way. Each moment with her is a special moment that melts away your heart and brings smile. This valentine, why not amaze her with this beautiful love themed cushion. Gift this cushion to her and show that how much you care for&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Forever Always Special','Forever Always Special','Forever Always Special','Forever Always Special'),(711,1,'Munificent Mommy','A mother is she who can take the place of all but whose place no one else can ever take. So celebrate your mother\'s undying love with Ferns N Petals in a unique way. Get a lovely hamper of 12x12 inches mother special cushion along with mother special white ceramic coffee mug and a greeting card and make her feel her importance in your life.','Munificent Mommy','Munificent Mommy','Munificent Mommy','Munificent Mommy'),(712,1,'Mom Is Special','&lt;p&gt;Mom is always the most special person in her children\'s life. This mother\'s day, let her know how precious she is to you with these wonderful gifts.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch cushion for mom.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One mug for mom.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;40 grams each of two dairy milk fruit n nut.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Mom Is Special','Mom Is Special','Mom Is Special','Mom Is Special'),(713,1,'I Wish Combo','Expressing your feelings can never be too much. Let your beloved cherish the warmth of your love and send her this cute combo of this red cushion and mug. Your gift contain: a red mug and a 12x12 miss you cushion','I Wish Combo','I Wish Combo','I Wish Combo','I Wish Combo'),(714,1,'Delightful Sister Combo','Delightful Sister Combo\', from Ferns N Petals, will give a true delight to your sister. This is a combo of One 12X12 inches Cushion and One Mug, both with the message, \'I am so lucky to have a sister like you\', printed on them and 4 Lotto Choco Pie Packs.','Delightful Sister Combo','Delightful Sister Combo','Delightful Sister Combo','Delightful Sister Combo'),(715,1,'One In Million Brother Combo','Do you believe that god has gifted you with the best brother in the world? If yes, then this special combo will convey the same to your loving brother, be it any occasion. This comprises of One 12X12 inches Cushion and One Mug, both with message \'Brother you are one in a million\', printed on them.','One In Million Brother Combo','One In Million Brother Combo','One In Million Brother Combo','One In Million Brother Combo'),(716,1,'You are Mine Cushion n Mug','&lt;p&gt;Add a little touch of extra special to your proposal. Capture the romance of your time together with these beautiful love cushion and mug. It\'s a wonderful way to say- You are Mine.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 12x12 inch love cushion.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One love mug.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;There is only one happiness in life- to love and be loved.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','You are Mine Cushion n Mug','You are Mine Cushion n Mug','You are Mine Cushion n Mug','You are Mine Cushion n Mug'),(717,1,'Red Romance','Saying I Love You with a gift is all the more special. This special combo of a mug and a cushion which speaks absolutely what you want to say. Your gift contain: A mug and a 12x12 Red Hug Cushion','Red Romance','Red Romance','Red Romance','Red Romance'),(718,1,'Because You Are The Greatest','A father is a person who has made your childhood a memorable experience. Don\'t forget to surprise him with this combo of a mug and a cushion. Let your father feel the depth of your true love and respect with this exclusive combo. Your gift contains: Always standing by side cushion, Always Standing By Side White Mug','Because You Are The Greatest','Because You Are The Greatest','Because You Are The Greatest','Because You Are The Greatest'),(719,1,'Special Combo For Brother','Tell your brother that how much you love him and what you really feel about him on his special occasions via this special gift combo. This encompasses of White 12X12 inches inches Cushion and White Coffee Mug with lovely quotations printed on them and 3 Cadbury Dairy Milk Chocolates of 17 grams each.','Special Combo For Brother','Special Combo For Brother','Special Combo For Brother','Special Combo For Brother'),(720,1,'Good Luck For Sister','Make your sister\'s life prosperous and happy, by gifting her this \'Good Luck For Sister\' combo. This includes One 12X12 inches Cushion with message \'Sisters make the best friends\', Two-layered Bamboo Plant for good luck and 2 Yellow Decorative Round Candles.','Good Luck For Sister','Good Luck For Sister','Good Luck For Sister','Good Luck For Sister'),(721,1,'The Magic of Love','&lt;p&gt;Daughters are the best blessings of God, so why not to celebrate their existence by naming a day after them. Celebrate the Daughter\'s Day and gift your daughter/s with this charming pink combo of a Coffee Mug, along with a matching Cushion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink and White Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The Magic of Love','The Magic of Love','The Magic of Love','The Magic of Love'),(722,1,'Splendid Beauty','&lt;p&gt;Express your enormous love towards your daughter through this perfect combo. This Daughter\'s Day, gift her the offered Cushion, along with a matching Coffee Mug. What makes this gift so special are the words written upon it, To the World\'s Best Daughter.. You\'re the Most Beautiful Gift Anyone Has Ever Been Gifted With.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One 12x12 inches Cushion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Beige &amp; White Printed Mug&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Splendid Beauty','Splendid Beauty','Splendid Beauty','Splendid Beauty'),(723,1,'Sweet and Warm Surprise','&lt;p&gt;What could be a better gift for your daughter, than a pack of assorted chocolates? Adding to its charm is a Pink colored charming Coffee Mug, when presented together, beautifully expresses your unconditional love towards your daughter without any words. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;10 pcs. Assorted Chocolate in a Pouch&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink and White Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sweet and Warm Surprise','Sweet and Warm Surprise','Sweet and Warm Surprise','Sweet and Warm Surprise'),(724,1,'Glory of the Pearls','&lt;p&gt;Celebrate the happiness of having the best gift of life, Daughters, with gifting the offered exciting combo. What makes this combo exclusive is the mesmeric Necklace and earrings set, along with a printed mug to add-on to its charm. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Necklace set (Necklace &amp; Earrings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink and White Printed Mug&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Glory of the Pearls','Glory of the Pearls','Glory of the Pearls','Glory of the Pearls'),(725,1,'Glorified Emotions','&lt;p&gt;Chocolates, Coffee, Fashion Accessories and Soft Toys, the most loved objects by girls are brought together in the form of a combo by the ferns N Petals for this Daughter\'s Day. Bring a big smile on your daughter\'s face by this combo and make her day amazing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink Teddy with Heart 7 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stone Bracelet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk 60gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Beige Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Glorified Emotions','Glorified Emotions','Glorified Emotions','Glorified Emotions'),(726,1,'A Pack of Happiness','&lt;p&gt;The dream of receiving a perfect present will come true, when you will present your daughter this exclusively designed combo for the occasion of Daughter\'s Day. Including everything that every girl loves, this pack of happiness is all you need to present this Daughter\'s Day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink Teddy With heart 7 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Greeting Card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Beige &amp; White Printed 12x12 inches Cushion &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Beige and White Coffee Mug&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','A Pack of Happiness','A Pack of Happiness','A Pack of Happiness','A Pack of Happiness'),(727,1,'Daughter The Love of Your Life','&lt;p&gt;Present a bit more of comfort and pleasure to your daughter, through the offered combo by Ferns N Petals. A cute cushion with an adorable message on it and a box of chocolates to delight, such a present will turn her day grand and joyful.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One 12x12 inches Pink Printed Cushion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One De MiamiA Truffles Set of Nine Box&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Daughter The Love of Your Life','Daughter The Love of Your Life','Daughter The Love of Your Life','Daughter The Love of Your Life'),(728,1,'The King Duology','&lt;p&gt;No one can ignore the efforts given by a hard working leader. For such amazing leaders of your organization, Ferns N Petals offers this motivating combo of a Cushion and Mug that read You are the Boss that supports like a Leader and rules like a King.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beige Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Beige Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The King Duology','The King Duology','The King Duology','The King Duology'),(729,1,'Leading Instinct','&lt;p&gt;Every one loves to be on the top, but indeed it takes a lot of efforts to reach there and control the things as they should be. Present a token of thanks to your boss for taking the charge and running the things smooth by presenting this gorgeous combo of Cushion and Mug that quote Keep Calm and Lean On. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Electric Blue Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Electric Blue Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Leading Instinct','Leading Instinct','Leading Instinct','Leading Instinct'),(730,1,'Regime of Brilliance','&lt;p&gt;Building an empire takes the efforts that only a leader can provide. For all the efforts that are given by your leader of organization, present this zealful combo of a Cushion and a matching Mug that reads Building the Empire. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Black Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Black Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Regime of Brilliance','Regime of Brilliance','Regime of Brilliance','Regime of Brilliance'),(731,1,'Crown of Passion','&lt;p&gt;There can never be a better person in an organization than the leader. A person, who not only attains success, but also help others to attain the same. Thank that leader this Boss Day by presenting the offered special combo by Ferns N Petals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Electric Blue Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Bounty&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Electric Blue Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Crown of Passion','Crown of Passion','Crown of Passion','Crown of Passion'),(732,1,'Warmth of Love','&lt;p&gt;Make your daughter feel like a Princess, the way she is, gift her this classy combo that includes a Frame with beautiful words, a Pink Coffee Mug and Chocolates. This combination is capable of telling how much you love her, which is all she wants to feel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;An A4 Size Frame&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink &amp; White Printed Mug&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Delfi Twister Choco Box 320gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Warmth of Love','Warmth of Love','Warmth of Love','Warmth of Love'),(733,1,'Delight for the Leader','&lt;p&gt;Motivation, zeal and efforts, when you hear these words, the very first image that comes to the mind is of the leader of your organization. Present this delighting Combo of Cushion, Mug and Assorted Chocolates to your leader and let him/her know how much you respect. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Black Cushion 12x12 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;De MiamiAssorted Premium Chocolates 12 pcs. blue ribbon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Black Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Delight for the Leader','Delight for the Leader','Delight for the Leader','Delight for the Leader'),(734,1,'Birthday Wishes','&lt;p&gt;Coffee Mugs are always the most loved and cherished entities for everyone. So gift one to the birthday boy/girl and see how instantly it turns into their favorite. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Yellow and White Color Non Personalized Mug&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Birthday Wishes','Birthday Wishes','Birthday Wishes','Birthday Wishes'),(735,1,'All The Wishes Come True','&lt;p&gt;While the excitement and celebration of the Birthday will be on peak, presenting something exquisite will escalate the joys of the occasion to another level. So why not to present this specially designed Mug with blessings and wishes. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Pink Color Non personalized White Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','All The Wishes Come True','All The Wishes Come True','All The Wishes Come True','All The Wishes Come True'),(736,1,'Guide to Success','&lt;p&gt;For all the efforts that have been put together by your boss in running the organization in the most flawless manner, present your gratitude in the form of this stylish Mug that will motivate him to take the charge in even better ways.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Electric Blue Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Guide to Success','Guide to Success','Guide to Success','Guide to Success'),(737,1,'Super Dad Coffee Mug','A father is like a farmer, who sows a seed and waits for good or bad weather to harvest but and is always working and teaches us to keep working and its is always what is needed. So make this Fathers Day super special for your Dad. Surprise him with a cool father special printed white ceramic coffee mug from Ferns N Petals and enjoy your cuppas with your amazing Dad.','Super Dad Coffee Mug','Super Dad Coffee Mug','Super Dad Coffee Mug','Super Dad Coffee Mug'),(738,1,'My Momma Is The Best','Mom is such a special word, the loveliest I\'ve ever heard. Toasts to you above all the rest, Mom you\'re so special, you are simply the best. Wish your super Mom Happy Mother\'s Day with a gift of Mother special quotes printed on a beautiful white ceramic coffee mug from Ferns N Petals.','My Momma Is The Best','My Momma Is The Best','My Momma Is The Best','My Momma Is The Best'),(739,1,'Moms Best Smile','&lt;p&gt;Mom\'s smile is so contagious, it makes everyone smile. The mug is just the perfect gift for the mom with the best smile.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One mom\'s best smile mug.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;ldquo;The sweetest sounds to mortals given are heard in Mother, Home, and Heaven.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Moms Best Smile','Moms Best Smile','Moms Best Smile','Moms Best Smile'),(740,1,'Beloved Daughter','&lt;p&gt;Express the warmth of your love towards your daughter, celebrate the joys of this Daughter\'s day with an alluring present. Gift your daughter with this cute and pretty pink colored mug with the message The Best Thing in the World is Seeing My Daughter Happy printed on it. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink and White Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Beloved Daughter','Beloved Daughter','Beloved Daughter','Beloved Daughter'),(741,1,'Mug For Dad','You have made a million mistakes but he never left your side. He always had the solution and taught you ways of life. Get this mug for your dad and tell him how much you feel blessed being his little one. Your Gift contains: A Mug for Dad','Mug For Dad','Mug For Dad','Mug For Dad','Mug For Dad'),(742,1,'Grandma and Grandpa Mug','Celebrate Grandparents Day with your grandma and grandpa, by presenting this cute printed mug to them. This is a Printed Mug with message \'Grandma &amp; grandpa you are the sunshine that helps me to grow\'.','Grandma and Grandpa Mug','Grandma and Grandpa Mug','Grandma and Grandpa Mug','Grandma and Grandpa Mug'),(743,1,'Coffee Mug For Dad','Show your dad that how much you love him by presenting him this special Coffee Mug For Dad, from Ferns N Petals. This is a Black Color Coffee Mug with \'I Love You Dad\' message on it along with a dad and little kid image.','Coffee Mug For Dad','Coffee Mug For Dad','Coffee Mug For Dad','Coffee Mug For Dad'),(744,1,'Best Sister Coffee Mug','Bring a delightful smile on the face of your sister, by gifting her this special present on any of her occasion or even on no occasion. This is a White &amp; Red Color Coffee Mug with message, \'Simply the best sister\', printed on it.','Best Sister Coffee Mug','Best Sister Coffee Mug','Best Sister Coffee Mug','Best Sister Coffee Mug'),(745,1,'Lots of Love Combo','&lt;p&gt;A sweet reminder with an expression of love. Give your sweetheart a lovely surprise with this tabletop decor and mug. Don\'t forget to give them a sweet tooth with love chocolates.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Love chocolate cookies 4 pcs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Love mug.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;I love you tabletop decor.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Then love knew it was called love. And when I lifted my eyes to your name, suddenly your heart showed me my way.','Lots of Love Combo','Lots of Love Combo','Lots of Love Combo','Lots of Love Combo'),(746,1,'I Love You Mug','&lt;p&gt;This Valentine\'s Day convey all the sentiment of blissful love that has grown between you two over the years. Set the mood with this valentine gift which is all cute and charming. This I Love You Mug expresses what is there in your heart and takes your partner on a romantic ride.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One I love you mug.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;You give but little when you give of your possessions. It is when you give of yourself that you truly give.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','I Love You Mug','I Love You Mug','I Love You Mug','I Love You Mug'),(747,1,'Perfect Together','&lt;p&gt;Yes, you look perfect together! Tell your beloved how special your love is with these wonderful valentine gifts. Personalize the greeting card for a romantic experience.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 2 inch teddy bear.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One kiss mug.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Two ball candles.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One 6x9 inch personalized valentine greeting card.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please Note: Send us a high resolution picture to be printed on the card and the order number at image@myfnp.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;','Perfect Together','Perfect Together','Perfect Together','Perfect Together'),(748,1,'Best Physician Mug','Appreciate the passion of your physician and gift him suave and sophisticated coffee mug with a whacky message on it. Your gift contains a coffee mug.','Best Physician Mug','Best Physician Mug','Best Physician Mug','Best Physician Mug'),(749,1,'For A Nice Doctor','Manifest the gratefulness of your Physician to the entire world by gifting him this elegant mug this Doctor.','For A Nice Doctor','For A Nice Doctor','For A Nice Doctor','For A Nice Doctor'),(750,1,'Healthy Hamper','Is your doctor fond of green tea and cookies? If yes, then its a perfect doctor\'s day gift for him. Your gift contain: Awesome Doctor Mug, Malaki Cookies, Twinning Green Tea &amp; Mint 20 Tea Bags','Healthy Hamper','Healthy Hamper','Healthy Hamper','Healthy Hamper'),(751,1,'Present for the Princess','&lt;p&gt;When you saw your daughter for the very first time, indeed it turned into a love at first sight. Let her feel how much you love and care for her by presenting something wonderful and gracious like this delicate Coffee Mug. With the message To the World\'s Best DaughterA€¦ You\'re the Most Beautiful Gift anyone has ever been gifted with quoted upon it, this Mug will surely turn this Daughter\'s Day, the best day ever for her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Beige and White Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Present for the Princess','Present for the Princess','Present for the Princess','Present for the Princess'),(752,1,'Emperor to Reign','&lt;p&gt;While the day of your boss starts with a mug of coffee, make that much more special by presenting this alluring Mug that quotes Building The Empire. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Black Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Emperor to Reign','Emperor to Reign','Emperor to Reign','Emperor to Reign'),(753,1,'Just For U','&lt;p&gt;Like the game of chess is ruled by the king, organizations are ruled by the leaders. This Boss Day, present your respect towards that leader by offering this zealful Mug, which quotes You are the Boss that supports like a Leader and rules like a King.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;White Mug with Beige Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Just For U','Just For U','Just For U','Just For U'),(754,1,'Say It With Bamboo','Like every other person, you also wish for your dad\'s success, good health and prosperity. That is why, Ferns N Petals has come up with a special gift this Father\'s Day. This is a 3 layer bamboo plant in a 4.5 inches acrylic vase, tied with a dark green satin ribbon.','Say It With Bamboo','Say It With Bamboo','Say It With Bamboo','Say It With Bamboo'),(755,1,'Blooming Tranquility','&lt;p&gt;This attractive potted plant arranged in a mini cycle is great for smaller spaces and desktops and are thought to bring their owner luck. Also known as Jade plant or Friendship Tree, they are extremely easy to care for and will thrive even in darker rooms. Said to bring luck and fortune, they make great gift for your loved ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Green Cycle with Pot&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Money Plant&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul','Blooming Tranquility','Blooming Tranquility','Blooming Tranquility','Blooming Tranquility'),(756,1,'Lucky Love','Brighten up your loved ones day with an amazing gift hamper from Ferns N Petals. Gift your beloved a gift hamper of 2 layered lucky bamboo plant in a glass vase with red crystal in it along with 1 heart shaped chocolate lollipop and a Ferns N Petals greeting card.','Lucky Love','Lucky Love','Lucky Love','Lucky Love'),(757,1,'Bonsai Beauty','Are you crazy about your gardening skills and want to explore more as to