ivity and prosperity.','Money Plant In Wooden Vase','Money Plant In Wooden Vase','Money Plant In Wooden Vase','Money Plant In Wooden Vase'),(785,1,'Lucky Time','Good Luck comes with time, let it start now. Gift your Doctor this Lucky Bamboo Plant placed in a quirky mug with a stylish clock by its side. Your gift contains one mug, 1 lucky Bamboo Plant and 1 golden Apple Clock.','Lucky Time','Lucky Time','Lucky Time','Lucky Time'),(786,1,'Healthier Happier Livelier','Its been a long time since you last visited your doctor and knowing his profession, its quite likely that he might got exhausted. Its your turn to ensure his happy and lively life this Doctor\'s Day. Send him this potted plant along with Tetly tea bags and coffee mug as a small token of care and make sure positivity surrounds him. Your gift contain: Sansevieria plant, Tetley 10 bags, Coffee Mug','Healthier Happier Livelier','Healthier Happier Livelier','Healthier Happier Livelier','Healthier Happier Livelier'),(787,1,'Good Luck Plant 3 layers','Good Luck Plant 3 layers','Good Luck Plant 3 layers','Good Luck Plant 3 layers','Good Luck Plant 3 layers','Good Luck Plant 3 layers'),(788,1,'Prosperous Spiritual Hamper','&lt;p&gt;Spread spirituality in the house of your loved ones. Make a serene environment with this idol of Ganesha and potourri and shower lots of good luck with this lucky bamboo plant.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Two layer lucky bamboo plant.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Vase.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;An idol of lord Ganesha.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Pack of potpourri.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Prosperous Spiritual Hamper','Prosperous Spiritual Hamper','Prosperous Spiritual Hamper','Prosperous Spiritual Hamper'),(789,1,'Ficus Microcarpa Plant','Protect nature! Its dying! Order this special plant Ficus Microcarpa Plant today and the nature will bloom again .It is a topiary tree reaching 30 metres (98 ft) tall in natural conditions, with gracefully drooping branchlets and glossy leaves 6?13 cm (2?5 in) long, oval with an acuminate tip. Care &amp; Instructions1. Select a site with bright, filtered light.Early-morning or late-afternoon sun is fine, but avoid an area that gets direct sun all day. 2. Avoid overwatering your ficus! The most common mistake people make is to add more water once the leaves begin to turn yellow. This is the opposite of what you should do. Always feel the surface of the soil with your finger tip. If it feels dry to the touch one inch below the surface, it is time to water. If the soil still feels moist, withhold water for a day or two. Order it to protect nature! These plants will be shipped as saplings &amp; may not always resemble the image shown. The images are representative &amp; depict a fully grown healthy plant.','Ficus Microcarpa Plant','Ficus Microcarpa Plant','Ficus Microcarpa Plant','Ficus Microcarpa Plant'),(790,1,'A Good Luck Charm','Shower tons of luck and prosperity on your daddy this Fathers Day by gifting him Good Luck Charm combo from Ferns N Petals. This gift combo includes one 12X12 inch cushion, 3 layer lucky bamboo plant in a basket, a cute pouch with 60 grams of assorted chocolates.','A Good Luck Charm','A Good Luck Charm','A Good Luck Charm','A Good Luck Charm'),(791,1,'Rose Plant with Choco Pie','Turn the day into an unforgettable moment with this miniature rose plant which flaunts its rich red blossoms amongst lush green foliage. Add sweetness to the day with 168 grams of choco pie.','Rose Plant with Choco Pie','Rose Plant with Choco Pie','Rose Plant with Choco Pie','Rose Plant with Choco Pie'),(792,1,'Lucky Charm For My Mom','On the occasion of Mother\'s Day, bring some good luck in your mother\'s life, by sending her this beautiful Three-Stemmed Lucky Bamboo Plant, along with a table top with a lovely message. You Gifts contains: Best thing in the world table top and Cut leaf bmaboo plant','Lucky Charm For My Mom','Lucky Charm For My Mom','Lucky Charm F