e Gift Set','Good Fortune Gift Set'),(796,1,'Lucky Bamboo In Green Vase','&lt;p&gt;A great way to wish health and prosperity ! Lucky bamboo plant will bring happiness and in any room. Its a gift that they can be enjoyed and kept for a long time.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Two layer lucky bamboo plant in a vase.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Love is a song that never ends.','Lucky Bamboo In Green Vase','Lucky Bamboo In Green Vase','Lucky Bamboo In Green Vase','Lucky Bamboo In Green Vase'),(797,1,'Exotic Greens','&lt;p&gt;Famous decorative plant with beautiful and artistic leaves, this Jabra plant is sure to purify air for your home. If you are in search of disease free and higher surviving plant, then, this beautiful cultured plant is ideal takeaway for your home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Gerbera Plant&lt;/ul&gt;','Exotic Greens','Exotic Greens','Exotic Greens','Exotic Greens'),(798,1,'Growing 24x7','A money plant is said have the most amazing growth and lively impact on the surrounding. Send this Money Plant to your family doctor and make him feel how much he is valued. Your gift contain: A money plant','Growing 24x7','Growing 24x7','Growing 24x7','Growing 24x7'),(799,1,'Symbolism Of Luck','&lt;p&gt;This lovely green leaf dwarf Molina in red pot is the easiest indoor species. Styled in a traditional broom design, its unsweeping green leaves makes an ideal gift and one to keep at your entrance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Molina&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Red Pot 3 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Symbolism Of Luck','Symbolism Of Luck','Symbolism Of Luck','Symbolism Of Luck'),(800,1,'Lucky Charm with Choco','&lt;p&gt;It is a perfect green gift for gifting special one on their birthday. This gift hamper includes a greeting card, assor