your loved ones by gifting them this exquisite combo of lucky bamboo and a ceramic printed mug.','Luck in the Mug','Luck in the Mug','Luck in the Mug','Luck in the Mug'),(804,1,'Makes You Feel Loved Again','Spread the magic of love and let your beloved experience it. Get him/her the gift hamper of 2 inch teddy bear, along with 2 pieces of Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates 14 grams each &amp; let them indulge themselves in the sweet world of love and chocolate. To add more to the deal, we have included a 5.5 inch love quote tabletop memento, a Ferns N Petals greeting card and a round candle to it.','Makes You Feel Loved Again','Makes You Feel Loved Again','Makes You Feel Loved Again','Makes You Feel Loved Again'),(805,1,'Brighten Up Your Love With Smile','Impress your love with a romantic and bright gift hamper from Ferns n Petals. Get a sunny bright hamper of 12x12 inches yellow smiley face cushion along with a 5X5 inches love quote table top memento. To add a little sweetness to the deal, we have also included 21.5 grams each of three Cadbury 5 star chocolate. So, make her day as bright as her smile.','Brighten Up Your Love With Smile','Brighten Up Your Love With Smile','Brighten Up Your Love With Smile','Brighten Up Your Love With Smile'),(806,1,'Ultimate Indulgence','Gifting this particular gift hamper guarantees you to be awarded with innumerable hugs and kisses at any occasion. The bouquet consist one 6 inch teddy, five 2 inch teddy bears, 7 piece of ferrero rocher chocolates decorated with artificial red rose petals, tied together with beautiful bows and everything enclosed in a white wrapping paper.','Ultimate Indulgence','Ultimate Indulgence','Ultimate Indulgence','Ultimate Indulgence'),(807,1,'Lovable cutest dog','Good news for dog lovers! Ferns N Petals are here with the cutest dog in town exclusively for you. Get this amazing cute 12-14 inches dog shaped soft toy with a red bow around the neck and add some cuteness to your bedroom. An ideal gift for any special occasion. Especially for your little ones who would be bewildered with their fluffy new friend to play with.','Lovable cutest dog','Lovable cutest dog','Lovable cutest dog','Lovable cutest dog'),(808,1,'See Saw In Love','Make her heart seesaw with happiness and love with an out of box gift that she will cherish forever. Get her a beautiful love memento of 12 x 6 inch wooden seesaw decorated with artificial flowers carrying 2.5 inch and 2 inch teddy bears. Express your deep feeling of your heart of staying with her through thick and thin of life. Ideal gifting option for any occasion.','See Saw In Love','See Saw In Love','See Saw In Love','See Saw In Love'),(809,1,'Your Daily Doze Of Romance','Love makes everything lovely. So make the day lovely for that special someone who is the reason for the loveliness of your life with an amazing gift hamper with Ferns N Petals. Get a gift hamper of 10 inches cute off white teddy bear along with 200 grams of ferrero Rocher chocolate box and 1 beautiful artificial rose.','Your Daily Doze Of Romance','Your Daily Doze Of Romance','Your Daily Doze Of Romance','Your Daily Doze Of Romance'),(810,1,'Birthday Cushion and Soft Toy','Send a lovely birthday gift to your loved one which they can cuddle and hug anytime they want. Delight them on their birthday with an extra cute birthday cushion and an adorable puppy soft toy.','Birthday Cushion and Soft Toy','Birthday Cushion and Soft Toy','Birthday Cushion and Soft Toy','Birthday Cushion and Soft Toy'),(811,1,'Monkey and Rocher','Spoil and pamer your loved one, for it is their birthday. Make them feel special with a cute monkey soft toy to cuddle and 200 grams of delicious Ferrero Rocher.','Monkey and Rocher','Monkey and Rocher','Monkey and Rocher','Monkey and Rocher'),(812,1,'Sweet Love Hamper','Make someone smile with the gift of an extra plush and very cuddly teddy. Get your dear one a hamper of 10 inches lovely teddy bear along with 2 rose shaped white chocolate lollipops in white an