13 inches cute cuddling soft toy with a Santa Claus cap will make them scream out with happiness and will double their joy. Made with skin friendly fabric and materials and can be washed at home making it children friendly toy unlike many others available on the stacks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Teddy Bear &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Soft O Cuddlesome','Soft O Cuddlesome','Soft O Cuddlesome','Soft O Cuddlesome'),(817,1,'Chocolaty Fluffy Love Hamper','Anything is good if it is made of chocolate. So, let your love be played like music with the sweetness of chocolates and fluffiness of a teddy. Get beautiful gifts hamper for your love including a bouquet of 10 pieces of Cadbury Dailrymilk chocolate 17 grams each along with 10 inch teddy bear. Make your beloved\'s day filled with love and fluffiness.','Chocolaty Fluffy Love Hamper','Chocolaty Fluffy Love Hamper','Chocolaty Fluffy Love Hamper','Chocolaty Fluffy Love Hamper'),(818,1,'Huggable Teddy','&lt;p&gt;Are you wondering to convey your best wishes to someone special? This cute creamy teddy bear is right way to serve token of appreciation. This fluffy creamy teddy is perfect gifting acquaintance and is sure to delight your loved ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Cream Teddy height 13 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Huggable Teddy','Huggable Teddy','Huggable Teddy','Huggable Teddy'),(819,1,'Cuddlesome Monkey','&lt;p&gt;Delight your loved ones with this orange cheer monkey. Gift your little toddlers with this exclusive soft toy and make them feel happy. Made from superior quality material, it is soft and fury to touch. This beautiful cheeky monkey is soft enough to hang onto your arms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Orange Monkey height 13 inches &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Cuddlesome Monkey','Cuddlesome Monkey','Cuddlesome Monkey','Cuddlesome Monkey'),(820,1,'The Best Darn Kiss You Can Ever Get','A kiss is a lovely trick designed by the nature to stop speech when words become superfluous. So let them have a token of your love in the form of a cute 6x6 inch kissing booth exclusively available at Ferns N Petals. The beautiful 6x6 inch wooden kissing booth has a cute kissing 2 inch teddy bear that will always remind your beloved of the good times you have spent together.','The Best Darn Kiss You Can Ever Get','The Best Darn Kiss You Can Ever Get','The Best Darn Kiss You Can Ever Get','The Best Darn Kiss You Can Ever Get'),(821,1,'Ribbed For The Chocolates','Chocolate doesn\'t make the world go around, but it sure does make the trip worthwhile! So make your special feel important with this amazing gift of 100 grams of heart shaped assorted chocolates in a beautiful golden box. To add fluffiness to the hamper we have included a cute 6-7 inch teddy bear to the deal.','Ribbed For The Chocolates','Ribbed For The Chocolates','Ribbed For The Chocolates','Ribbed For The Chocolates'),(822,1,'Smiley For You','A smile is a curve that sets everything straight. So make someone smile forever with a gift that will be cherished by your loved ones forever. Gift them 12 x 12 inch smiley face yellow cushion and make happiness a permanent element in their life. This cushion is made of skin friendly easy to wash material giving it a long life.','Smiley For You','Smiley For You','Smiley For You','Smiley For You'),(823,1,'Cute Flower Shaped Pillow','Get a flower so fluffy and cuddly that no one will ever be able to resist themselves from squishing it. Get a beautiful 12 x 12 inch flower shaped pillow to ensure your loved one gets their good night sleep with the most tenderness you wish for.','Cute Flower Shaped Pillow','Cute Flower Shaped Pillow','Cute Flower Shaped Pillow','Cute Flower Shaped Pillow'),(824,1,'Love Feast','Let your love know that they are your entire universe this time in the most special way. Gift them a hamper of 10 inches off white teddy bear with a heart along with 3 pieces of Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates 38 grams each and a Ferns N Petals greeting card. Surprise her on an occasion like Valentine\'s Day and make it the most special and memorable day of her life.','Love Feast','Love Feast','Love Feast','Love Feast'),(825,1,'Childhood Relived Hamper','You really don\'t have to be young to find a friend in a teddy bear. So relive your childhood and make someone feel the same with this ultimate hamper of a 10 inhes teddy bear and 2X2 inchtable top memento from Ferns N Petals and make them feel important.','Childhood Relived Hamper','Childhood Relived Hamper','Childhood Relived Hamper','Childhood Relived Hamper'),(826,1,'Love Pool','&lt;p&gt;This is a perfect gift for your little ones. Give this bag to your child for school and see he/she will never feel like missing his school even a single day. This bag can be used for picnic as well. This is widely popular among children going to kindergarten&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Teddy Bag 11x11 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Love Pool','Love Pool','Love Pool','Love Pool'),(827,1,'Together Like Kangaroos','&lt;p&gt;A cute kangaroo mommy and baby for your adorable mother. These cute kangaroos depict the sweet relation you share with your mother. Gift it to her and adorn her living room.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One kangaroo soft toy.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;ldquo;Youth fades, love droops, the leaves of friendship fall, a mother\'s secret hope outlives them all.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Together Like Kangaroos','Together Like Kangaroos','Together Like Kangaroos','Together Like Kangaroos'),(828,1,'Hug For You','&lt;p&gt;Put a smile in their heart with a cute hugging teddy and sweet gifts. There is nothing like sending a hug to your sweetheart when you are not there in person to give them a hug.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One hugging teddy.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;100 reasons why I love you booklet.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;60 grams of 1 dairy milk silk.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Hug For You','Hug For You','Hug For You','Hug For You'),(829,1,'Cart Of Love','Make your mom travel to a world filled with your love and affection and leads of sweetness with this lovely hamper from Ferns N Petals. This hamper of 3 Cadbury Dairymilk chocolates 18 grams each along with 2X2 inches mother special quote and 2.5 inch cute small pink teddy bear sitting in a love cart and make her feel how how she is the reason for everything good in your life.','Cart Of Love','Cart Of Love','Cart Of Love','Cart Of Love'),(830,1,'Teddy with many hearts','Get the most huggable and lovable gift for someone special with number of hearts to add to its beauty. Gift 10 inches fawn teddy bear with many hearts to your girlfriend or wife or for that to your kids and see them rejoice in happiness. The non toxic and soft fabric assures it to be friendly to all the age group. An ideal gift for various special occasions like Birthdays, Anniversaries and Valentine\'s Day etc.','Teddy with many hearts','Teddy with many hearts','Teddy with many hearts','Teddy with many hearts'),(831,1,'Me And My Romance','Sometimes the heart sees what is invisible to the eye. So make your unconditional love felt by your beloved with the exclusive range of gifts with Ferns N Petals. Get 4x4 inch wooden bench with 2 teddy bear 2.5 inch each. Let these two loving soft toys symbolize your love for each other in a silent way.','Me And My Romance','Me And My Romance','Me And My Romance','Me And My Romance'),(832,1,'Love Cart','&lt;p&gt;This valentine\'s day feel your closeness and togetherness with cute and romantic teddies sitting on a cart. Charm your beautiful with this beautiful valentine gift.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 5 inch cart.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;2 inch each of two teddies.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Artificial flower arrangement.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;ÃƒÂƒÃ‚ÂƒÃƒÂ‚Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂƒÃ‚Â‚ÃƒÂ‚Ã‚Â€ÃƒÂƒÃ‚Â‚ÃƒÂ‚Ã‚ÂœIf I could choose between living and breathing, I would use my last breath to say I love you.ÃƒÂƒÃ‚ÂƒÃƒÂ‚Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂƒÃ‚Â‚ÃƒÂ‚Ã‚Â€ÃƒÂƒÃ‚Â‚ÃƒÂ‚Ã‚Â?','Love Cart','Love Cart','Love Cart','Love Cart'),(833,1,'Teddy Love n Cushion Valentine','&lt;p&gt;Confess your love to the special person in your life. Let the teddy bears do the talking and carry your message of love. Also send a love cushion as a way of expressing your love and accessorising the living space. These valentine gifts are a perfect keepsake and a reminder of your love.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Two teddy bears kissing on a heart cushion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;My heart is, and always will be, yours.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Teddy Love n Cushion Valentine','Teddy Love n Cushion Valentine','Teddy Love n Cushion Valentine','Teddy Love n Cushion Valentine'),(834,1,'Teddy Carrying Love','&lt;p&gt;Love comes from the heart. It is best expressed through a loving hug, a gentle caress or better still a romantic gift. Express your heartfelt desires in the most romantic and adorable way with cute and sweet valentine gifts.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 10 inch teddy bear.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;1 heart chocolate candy.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;100 reasons why I love you booklet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Falling in love is easy, but staying in love is very special.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Teddy Carrying Love','Teddy Carrying Love','Teddy Carrying Love','Teddy Carrying Love'),(835,1,'Love Teddies','&lt;p&gt;Love i