e the perfect crime if I stole your heart and you stole mine.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Date With Teddy','Love Date With Teddy','Love Date With Teddy','Love Date With Teddy'),(838,1,'Love Stairway','&lt;p&gt;A wonderful satirway to love ! Depicting your message of love are these cute teddies reaching out for each other. Climb the staircase of love to reach the love of your life.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 8 inch wooden stair with 2 inch each of two teddies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;There is a reason why two people stay together. They give each other something nobody else can.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Stairway','Love Stairway','Love Stairway','Love Stairway'),(839,1,'Pink Teddy','&lt;p&gt;Give your loved one abundance of joy. Express your love with the cutest soft toys available on earth. Extremely soft and huggable, this cute pink teddy bear has big eyes filled with lively twinkle. Just cuddle it, hug it or play with it.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 10 inch teddy bear.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;He loved her, of course, but better than that, he chose her, day after day. Choice: that was the thing.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Pink Teddy','Pink Teddy','Pink Teddy','Pink Teddy'),(840,1,'Token of Love','&lt;p&gt;The warmth of coffee, the softness of teddy and the sweetness of chocolates, being the best, yet they are nothing when compared to the love of your daughter. Gift her this captivating combo of a printed Coffee Mug, Chocolates and a Teddy to tell her what she means to you. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink Teddy 10.5 inches height&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Choco Swiss Variety of Six Pack Each Pack 90GMS (Premium Dark Chocolate, Fruit N Nut, Roasted Almonds &amp; Sea Salt, Butterscotch, Orange Truffle, Coffee)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One White and Beige Printed Mug&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Token of Love','Token of Love','Token of Love','Token of Love'),(841,1,'Cuddly Love Teddy','&lt;p&gt;Give your loved one a bundle of joy. Teddy bears are the cutest soft toys available on earth. This teddy bear is so cute and delightful that it will brighten up this Valentine\'s Day. Just cuddle it, hug it or play with it.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 20 inch teddy bear.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Long before I grew up, my Teddy bear taught me what love really meant: being there when you\'re needed.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Cuddly Love Teddy','Cuddly Love Teddy','Cuddly Love Teddy','Cuddly Love Teddy'),(842,1,'Marble Ganesha On A Chowki','Make your day filled with good luck and prosperity by bringing home small marble statue of Lord Ganesha sitting on a chowki from Ferns N Petals. The exquisite statue is an fine piece of Indian handicraft with Rajasthani hand painting with gold painted intricate details.','Marble Ganesha On A Chowki','Marble Ganesha On A Chowki','Marble Ganesha On A Chowki','Marble Ganesha On A Chowki'),(843,1,'Love Being A Woman','There is no better way to tell her that you adore her looks and that\'s the most flattering gift to be bestowed on a woman. Get a thoughtful gift of make up essentials from Ferns N Petals that are an integral part of woman\'s cosmetic kit. The hamper includes Gift hamper of 1 Nivea fruit shine cherry lip balm, 1 pink Maybelline nailpaint, 1 golden Maybelline nailpaint, and 1 COLOR ME Pink Body Spray 150Ml, 1 red ball candles and 1 heart shaped soft toys 3 inches beautifully placed in a cane basket. The decoration is used for display purpose only hence not included in the hamper.','Love Being A Woman','Love Being A Woman','Love Being A Woman','Love Being A Woman'),(844,1,'Token of Care','&lt;p&gt;A present, not only of deliciousness, but also of health, present health and taste to your dear ones by sending them the offered basket full of 500 grams Almonds and let them know you care.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Small Wooden Basket Diameter 5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Almonds 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Token of Care','Token of Care','Token of Care','Token of Care'),(845,1,'Say It With Leather Accessories','Choosing a perfect gift for men has always been a tough task for women. To solve this problem, Ferns N Petals has bring forth a stylish 3 Piece Leather Set that will surely leave your good impression on others. The set includes a big Leather Wallet/Card Holder (4X7.5 inches), small Wallet (5X4 inches) and a Key Chain (3 inches).','Say It With Leather Accessories','Say It With Leather Accessories','Say It With Leather Accessories','Say It With Leather Accessories'),(846,1,'Dry fruit Delight','Enjoy the sweets with the goodness of dry fruits. Get a box of 200 grams of pista badam Patti with Ferns N Petals and make winters brighter and sweeter with its taste.','Dry fruit Delight','Dry fruit Delight','Dry fruit Delight','Dry fruit Delight'),(847,1,'100 Reasons of Love n Locket','&lt;p&gt;Make your sweetheart fall in love with you. Tell her all the reasons of why you love her. Go a step ahead and tell her your love is forever. Give her not 1 or 2 but 100 reason of why you love her. Make her yours forever with a piece of your heart. This heart locket will be with her always enhancing her beauty. On this Valentine\'s Day, let your love outshine everything with these valentine gifts.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 100 reasons why I love you booklet.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One heart locket.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Be mine forever and I\'ll be yours longer than that.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','100 Reasons of Love n Locket','100 Reasons of Love n Locket','100 Reasons of Love n Locket','100 Reasons of Love n Locket'),(848,1,'Special Gift For Special Him','Tell your dad, brother or husband that you are special for me by gifting him a lovely combo from Ferns N Petals on his special occasion. This combo encompasses Parker pen and one Yardley body spray of 150 ml.','Special Gift For Special Him','Special Gift For Special Him','Special Gift For Special Him','Special Gift For Special Him'),(849,1,'Ganesha Bottle Lamp','&lt;p&gt;Let the blessings of lord Ganesha glow in the house. If you want to fill the house of your loved ones with spiritual delight, this lamp will do it for you. The warm glow of this lamp creates a subtle mood pleasing everyone.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One Ganesha bottle lamp.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The bulb is included. We recommend the use of a 15 watt bulb. Milky white or soft white bulb works the best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The wooden base holder is included and is a part of the product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo is visible even in when the lamp is not lit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo does not fade away with time.&lt;/p&gt;','Ganesha Bottle Lamp','Ganesha Bottle Lamp','Ganesha Bottle Lamp','Ganesha Bottle Lamp'),(850,1,'Brown Wallet','Timeless gifts for men in deep classic and seasonal tones! No matter how many wallets a man have, there is always a scope for a new one. Watch him overjoyed while receiving this as gift. Your gift contain: Brown Gents Wallet','Brown Wallet','Brown Wallet','Brown Wallet','Brown Wallet'),(851,1,'Deo and Mug Combo','Do you also consider your father as the best dad in the world? If yes, then its time to express your feeling to your father on this Fathers Day through a special gift combo from Ferns N Petals. This gift combo includes a Fathers Day Certificate which will surely bring tears of happiness in his eyes. It also has a 150 ml Yardley Body Spray and a classic black Coffee Mug.','Deo and Mug Combo','Deo and Mug Combo','Deo and Mug Combo','Deo and Mug Combo'),(852,1,'Golden Time Piece','A shiny piece of art for the corner of your living space. Gift this golden apple clock to your loved one on a special occasion and wish them good luck. Your gift contains: A Golden Apple Clock','Golden Time Piece','Golden Time Piece','Golden Time Piece','Golden Time Piece'),(853,1,'My Promise Candle','&lt;p&gt;This Valentine\'s Day make an eternal promise. Give your love a whole new meaning with this promise candle which says- I promise to fierecly love you in all your forms, now and forever, and promise to never forget that this is a once-in-a-lifetime love. You are the best thing that has ever happened to me. It will set the perfect mood for the perfect Valentine evening.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 4 inch promise candle.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;The reason it hurts so much to separate is because our souls are connected.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','My Promise Candle','My Promise Candle','My Promise Candle','My Promise Candle'),(854,1,'White Ganesha and Modak Chocolates','Known as the remover of obstacles, Lord Ganesha is honored at the beginning of ceremonies and rituals in Hindu religion. Shower his blessings on your loved ones through this combo, which includes One White Ganesha Idol of 3 inches , along with Modak Chocolates of 100 grams.','White Ganesha and Modak Chocolates','White Ganesha and Modak Chocolates','White Ganesha and Modak Chocolates','White Ganesha and Modak Chocolates'),(855,1,'I Love You Because Lamp','&lt;p&gt;Tell your sweetheart you love her in a bright and lovely way. This beautiful lamp with you and me will keep your lives aglow always.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One I love you because bottle lamp.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The bulb is included. We recommend the use of a 15 watt bulb. Milky white or soft white bulb works the best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The wooden base holder is included and is a part of the product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo is visible even in when the lamp is not lit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo does not fade away with time.&lt;/p&gt;','I Love You Because Lamp','I Love You Because Lamp','I Love You Because Lamp','I Love You Because Lamp'),(856,1,'Red and White Bathrobe For Her','Thinking of a useful yet unique gift for your wife or girl friend? If yes, then go for this nice Red &amp; White Bathrobe For Her, from Ferns N Petals. This bathrobe is made from a soft, colorfast and anti-piling fabric that gives it longer life and ensures comfort of the person.','Red and White Bathrobe For Her','Red and White Bathrobe For Her','Red and White Bathrobe For Her','Red and White Bathrobe For Her'),(857,1,'Stylish Organizer','A stylish black organizer along with a pen is all you need to make a lasting impression in a client meeting. This black organizer is considered to be a quintessential business gift to be gifted to any profession Your gift contain: An Executive Organizer','Stylish Organizer','Stylish Organizer','Stylish Organizer','Stylish Organizer'),(858,1,'Love Message In A Bottle','&lt;p&gt;This Valentine\'s Day send the message of your love to your sweetheart. Your sentiments of your love sent in a sweet way will melt their heart. This valentine gift is a brilliantly romantic way to say the three little words that mean so much, \'I love you\'.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One message in a bottle.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;If love lasts forever, then your\'forever\' is all i need. You\'re the love of my life, the light that shines bright. My destiny, my final abode, my love &amp; my only hope. I promise to love you more today than yesterday &amp; I\'ll love you more tomorrow than today.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Message In A Bottle','Love Message In A Bottle','Love Message In A Bottle','Love Message In A Bottle'),(859,1,'Forever Rainbow Rose','&lt;p&gt;Create memories that will never fade! This beautiful rainbow rose is a real rose, beautifully preserved and captured at its peak of perfection. It will remain fresh and soft for years. With this rose you can tell your significant other that your love is forever, unending. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;They can last several years if properly cared, just keep the flowers indoors, away from direct sunlight, heat, humidity and moisture. If the flowers becomes dusty, use a hairdryer or another type of gentle blower on a cool setting to clean.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One preserved rainbow rose in a gift box.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lovers don\'t finally meet somewhere. They are in each other all along.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Forever Rainbow Rose','Forever Rainbow Rose','Forever Rainbow Rose','Forever Rainbow Rose'),(860,1,'Bal Ganesha Combo','Shower the blessings of Lord Ganesha on your loved ones on this Ganesh Chaturthi with this divine idol. This is a combo of Kaju Katli of 250 grams, Modak of 100 grams, and Playing Bal Ganesha Idol of 4.5x3.5 inches in size.','Bal Ganesha Combo','Bal Ganesha Combo','Bal Ganesha Combo','Bal Ganesha Combo'),(861,1,'Magical Of Womanhood Hamper','Spell your magic of your unmatched style on everyone with the coolest hamper from Ferns N Petals. Get a trendy hamper of two Color show nail lacquers from Maybelline New York along with Lakme clean up face wash 100 grams and 2 heart shaped soft toys 2 inches each and cast your spell on everyone.','Magical Of Womanhood Hamper','Magical Of Womanhood Hamper','Magical Of Womanhood Hamper','Magical Of Womanhood Hamper'),(862,1,'Special Gift For A You','Sometimes letting your beloved how important she/he is for you. So make It\'special for your beloved this time with a lovely gift of a 5x5 inches love quote table top memento clubbed with the sweetness of 1 rose shaped white chocolate lollipop. It makes for an ideal gift for occasions such as Women\'s Day, Birthday and festivals.','Special Gift For A You','Special Gift For A You','Special Gift For A You','Special Gift For A You'),(863,1,'Serene Beauty','&lt;p&gt;Present an exquisite accessory to your daughter and add a graceful aura to her gorgeous looks. Ferns N Petals presents this eye-catching Stone Bracelet for your daughter, which will take her heart away and subtly tell her how much you love her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Stone Bracelet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Serene Beauty','Serene Beauty','Serene Beauty','Serene Beauty'),(864,1,'The Office Organizer','Help your friends and colleagues arrange their work station by gifting them corporate accessories with Ferns N Petals. Gift them leather gift hamper of A5 folder with 2 pen, a multi-utility pen holder with dry flower arrangement.','The Office Organizer','The Office Organizer','The Office Organizer','The Office Organizer'),(865,1,'Lord Buddha Lamp','&lt;p&gt;An alluring lamp radiating gentle and serene picture of lord Buddha! Spread calmness with the glow of this wonderful lamp. Unique and beautiful, this lamp will make an excellent gift for birthdays, anniversary or any other occasion.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One lord buddha bottle lamp.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The bulb is included. We recommend the use of a 15 watt bulb. Milky white or soft white bulb works the best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The wooden base holder is included and is a part of the product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo is visible even in when the lamp is not lit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo does not fade away with time.&lt;/p&gt;','Lord Buddha Lamp','Lord Buddha Lamp','Lord Buddha Lamp','Lord Buddha Lamp'),(866,1,'Sai Baba illuminance','&lt;p&gt;Welcome Sai Baba with all your heart and bring in all the good wishes to your home, this Mother\'s day. Let your Mother feel blessed on its arrival.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your gift contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; light green coloured Sai baba bottle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The bulb is included. We recommend the use of a 15 watt bulb. Milky white or soft white bulb works the best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The wooden base holder is included and is a part of the product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo is visible even in when the lamp is not lit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The photo does not fade away with time.&lt;/p&gt;','Sai Baba illuminance','Sai Baba illuminance','Sai Baba illuminance','Sai Baba illuminance'),(867,1,'Mom With Love','If you have a mom, there is nowhere you are likely to go where a prayer has not already been. So make it special for your super special Mom with this unique hamper of a beautiful faux flower arrangement in a round glass vase along with 4X4 Inch mother special table top memento from Ferns N Petals.','Mom With Love','Mom With Love','Mom With Love','Mom With Love'),(868,1,'Love Booklet With Rose','&lt;p&gt;Confess your love to the one who rules your heart. Give them all the reasons for your undying love with a love booklet and a rose. On this day of love say what is there in your heart with these lovely valentine gifts.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 100 reasons why I love you booklet.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One artificial rose flower.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;I never wanted to be your whole life- just your favourite part.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Booklet With Rose','Love Booklet With Rose','Love Booklet With Rose','Love Booklet With Rose'),(869,1,'Special Way To Say Love You','Why not show your dad with some love with a simple, meaningful gift, he\'ll definitely treasure for years to come. How about putting your feelings in writing on the wall? It surely is a great idea to express your feelings for your dad on any special day . Your gift contains: DAD Frame','Special Way To Say Love You','Special Way To Say Love You','Special Way To Say Love You','Special Way To Say Love You'),(870,1,'Blissful Ganesha Combo','Celebrate the birthday of Lord Ganesha by presenting this \'Blissful Ganesha Combo\' to your family and friends. This comprises of One 250 grams Pack of Soan Papdi, Almonds of 250 grams and One Mini Stone Ganesha Idol of 3 inches.','Blissful Ganesha Combo','Blissful Ganesha Combo','Blissful Ganesha Combo','Blissful Ganesha Combo'),(871,1,'Forever Mom Flower Arrangement','Mother is like a rocking chair, who is always ready to support with you but can not rock unless you take an initiave. So let your mother know how important she is for you with a small token of love from Ferns N Petals. Get an amazing gift hamper of faux flower arrangement in a fiber pot with FNP Mother special greeting card and make her day filled with vivid shades of joy and merriment.','Forever Mom Flower Arrangement','Forever Mom Flower Arrangement','Forever Mom Flower Arrangement','Forever Mom Flower Arrangement'),(872,1,'ur style statement','&lt;p&gt;If you are looking for something unique to delight your loved ones, this combo of wallet and card holder is a perfect gift to accentuate his handsome look. A fabulous perfume with enigmatic fragrance is also clubbed with this exceptional gift. Get for him and make him feel special.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;English Blazer London Deo 150ml &amp; Perfume 100ml&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mens Wallet &amp; Card Holder set&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','ur style statement','ur style statement','ur style statement','ur style statement'),(873,1,'Silver Palki With Bal Krishna','Celebrate the birthday of Lord Bal Krishna, by sending across this holy \'Silver Palki With Bal Krishna\' to your loved ones. Made up of white metal of size 6X7X4 inches, this Palki comes along with One Brass Bal Krishna Idol of 2 inches. color of poshaak may vary.','Silver Palki With Bal Krishna','Silver Palki With Bal Krishna','Silver Palki With Bal Krishna','Silver Palki With Bal Krishna'),(874,1,'100 Reasons Of Best Mom','&lt;p&gt;Mom is a daughter\'s best friend and a son\'s first love. Give your mom not one or two but hundred reasons of why she is the best mom in the whole world. She is going to be so happy you cant even imagine.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 100 reasons why you are the best mom booklet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;A€œMothers hold their child\'s hand for a moment and their hearts for a lifetime.A€?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','100 Reasons Of Best Mom','100 Reasons Of Best Mom','100 Reasons Of Best Mom','100 Reasons Of Best Mom'),(875,1,'The Perfect Apron','Gift your mom this kitchen apron and let her cook you the delicacies with immense joy and happiness.Your Gift contains: Mummy da dhaba apron','The Perfect Apron','The Perfect Apron','The Perfect Apron','The Perfect Apron'),(876,1,'Simple Impartial Love','Experience the romance in the air and make your beloved treasure it forever. Gift her/him a gift hamper of 3x6 inch love quote table top memento along with long stem artificial rose.','Simple Impartial Love','Simple Impartial Love','Simple Impartial Love','Simple Impartial Love'),(877,1,'Perfect Anniversary Gift','Anniversary is the occasion when a person seeks for a gift which can be kept and consumed for about a longer period of time. Send this oil diffuser along with a greeting card expressing warm wishes. Your gift contain: Happy Anniversary Greeting Card, Blackrose Essential Oil Diffuser','Perfect Anniversary Gift','Perfect Anniversary Gift','Perfect Anniversary Gift','Perfect Anniversary Gift'),(878,1,'Ganesha Resting On Charpai','&lt;p&gt;Shower the blessings of Lord Ganesha on your mother by presenting her this beautiful Ganesha Idol, resting on charpai, on the special occasion of Mother\'s Day.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gift contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Resting Ganesha Idol&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;1 Chaarpai.&lt;/li&gt;','Ganesha Resting On Charpai','Ganesha Resting On Charpai','Ganesha Resting On Charpai','Ganesha Resting On Charpai'),(879,1,'100 Reasons for Best Moms Combo','You know your mom is the best, but that\'s not enough. Tell your mom what you feel about her by gifting her this combo of \'100 reasons why your are the best mom\' and red heart-shaped chocolates. Gift contains: 100 reasons why you\'re the best Mom Red heart-shaped chocolates','100 Reasons for Best Moms Combo','100 Reasons for Best Moms Combo','100 Reasons for Best Moms Combo','100 Reasons for Best Moms Combo'),(880,1,'Mug For Your Lover','This mug from the house of Ferns N Petals is a special coffee mug, created for those who are in love and want to share their feelings with their lovers. This mug is personalized with a name of your lover.Send us the text that you want to get printed, along with the order number, to image@myfnp.com. Please send it right after placing the order to any delay in the delivery.','Mug For Your Lover','Mug For Your Lover','Mug For Your Lover','Mug For Your Lover'),(881,1,'A Beautiful Surprise','&lt;p&gt;What if all the things that your daughter loves, came as a combo? Exactly, here your search for the perfect present for your daughter ends, as Ferns N Petals offers you a perfect combo for the Daughter\'s Day. Including a Diary to write thoughts in, a Chocolate &amp; a Necklace and Earrings set to charm, this combo is something your daughter will love.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Necklace Set&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk 60gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Note Book 8x6 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','A Beautiful Surprise','A Beautiful Surprise','A Beautiful Surprise','A Beautiful Surprise'),(882,1,'100 Reasons of Love book','&lt;p&gt;Often you wonder what is the one thing that makes you fall in love with your sweetheart. This Valentines, give them not 1 or 2 but 100 reasons of why you love them. Let your love outshine everything with this valentine gift. &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 100 reason why I love you booklet. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;You are the answer to every prayer I have offered. You are a song, a dream, a whisper, and I dont know how I could have lived without you for as long as I have.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','100 Reasons of Love book','100 Reasons of Love book','100 Reasons of Love book','100 Reasons of Love book'),(883,1,'Key To Togetherness Key Chain','&lt;p&gt;A true symbol of your love, this key chain will remind you everyday of the journey together so far. Like the two of you, this girl and boy can also not stay away from each other. Feel your closeness and togetherness. Celebrate this Valentine\'s Day and charm your beautiful with this beautiful valentine gift.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One key chain.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;I saw that you were perfect and so I loved you. Then I saw that you were not perfect and I loved you even more.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Key To Togetherness Key Chain','Key To Togetherness Key Chain','Key To Togetherness Key Chain','Key To Togetherness Key Chain'),(884,1,'Heart Pendant','&lt;p&gt;Send her a piece of your heart. On this Valentine\'s Day, treat your precious lady with this stunning and charming heart necklace. This pendant dangling on her neck will look simply enchanting. Let her carry your love wherever she goes.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One heart pendant.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;Falling in love is easy, but staying in love is very special.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Heart Pendant','Heart Pendant','Heart Pendant','Heart Pendant'),(885,1,'Forever Green Rose','&lt;p&gt;A gorgeous natural beauty ! Give a sauve and sweet touch to your Valentine\'s day celebration with this Preserved Green Rose that will last forever. This fresh rose has been preserved to stay and look fresh for years. It\'s a symbolic gesture of your long lasting love.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;They can last several years if properly cared, just keep the flowers indoors, away from direct sunlight, heat, humidity and moisture. If the flowers becomes dusty, use a hairdryer or another type of gentle blower on a cool setting to clean.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One preserved green rose in a gift box. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Forever can never be long enough for me to feel like I\'ve had long enough with you.','Forever Green Rose','Forever Green Rose','Forever Green Rose','Forever Green Rose'),(886,1,'Pretty Tiara','&lt;p&gt;Let your sweetheart know she is a princess in your eyes. This heart melting sweet tiara will make an adorable addition to her wardrobe. This special gift can create a magical moment to help celebrate this special day. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One flower tiara.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;To me you are everything beautiful in this world.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Pretty Tiara','Pretty Tiara','Pretty Tiara','Pretty Tiara'),(887,1,'Love Message n Chocolates','&lt;p&gt;This Valentine\'s Day touch the heart of your sweetheart. Melt their heart with your sweet sentiments of love. Tell them in a unique way that their love will stay in your heart always and forever.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One message in a bottle.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;50 grams of assorted heart shaped chocolates.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;I would not wish any companion in the world but you.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Message n Chocolates','Love Message n Chocolates','Love Message n Chocolates','Love Message n Chocolates'),(888,1,'Love Hug','&lt;p&gt;Send a big hug to the love of your life for the times you are forced to spend apart. This greeting card with love chocolate will convey your love in the sweetest way possible and fill the space between the two of you.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One hug greeting card.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One I love you chocolate lolipop.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;I like hugs. I really like long hugs, the ones where you just don\'t want to let go.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Love Hug','Love Hug','Love Hug','Love Hug'),(889,1,'Propose Wall Clock','&lt;p&gt;Declare your infinite love with our propose wall clock. Down on your knees, you are all set to make her yours forever. It\'s a beautiful way to show your love.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One propose wall clock Made with MDF wood, height 15 inches &amp; lenth 10 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Propose Wall Clock','Propose Wall Clock','Propose Wall Clock','Propose Wall Clock'),(890,1,'Travel Companion','Doctors are always on the move and the Travel Grooming Kit filled with assorted items will be extremely practical when he goes on a medical call. Complement this handy gift with an inspirational work surface and wish him the very best on Doctors Day.Your gift contains: Positive Table Top and a Travel Grooming Kit','Travel Companion','Travel Companion','Travel Companion','Travel Companion'),(891,1,'Nutty and Crunchy','&lt;p&gt;Your loved ones know that you adore and love them, so let them know subtly that you care for their health too, by gifting this beautiful Metal Tray that comes with Almonds and Cashews. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Golden Square Tray 8.50X8.50&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Almonds 100gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cashew Nuts 100gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Nutty and Crunchy','Nutty and Crunchy','Nutty and Crunchy','Nutty and Crunchy'),(892,1,'Handy Greetings','On the occasion of Doctors Day, present your physician a gift of appreciation with our National Doctor Greeting Card and a Business Organizer that will be most helpful in his work.Your gift contains: National Doctor Greeting Card and a Business Organizer','Handy Greetings','Handy Greetings','Handy Greetings','Handy Greetings'),(893,1,'Sprite Favor','&lt;p&gt;Go ahead and gift this hamper to your dear ones that includes a brown &amp; black notebook. It is sure to make an unforgettable memory of your gift.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Brown &amp; Black Notebook 5.5x4.5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sprite Favor','Sprite Favor','Sprite Favor','Sprite Favor'),(894,1,'With Love to Doc','For some, their doctors are their best buddies, who not only give medications but their presence is a medication in itself. Annoy them this Doctor\'s Day and send this attitude coasters to them. Your gift contain: Attitude coasters for Doc','With Love to Doc','With Love to Doc','With Love to Doc','With Love to Doc'),(895,1,'Thank you Doc','is your doctor the person in your life whom you truly owe? This Doctor\'s Day, let them know what place they have in your life. Send them this classy coffee mug along with tea coasters and let your gift say they are the best doctor in the world. Your gift contain: Black Coffee Mug and two coasters','Thank you Doc','Thank you Doc','Thank you Doc','Thank you Doc'),(896,1,'Be Positive','As the doctor\'s day arrives, send your doctor a special gift and celebrate the day with your doctor and Ferns n Petals. Order this Aloe vera plant along with a table top and send this combo to them and make their day special. Your gift contain: Alovera, Think Possitive Table Top','Be Positive','Be Positive','Be Positive','Be Positive'),(897,1,'Drink Aid','Celebrate the occasion with an easy to carry customized Doctors Day sipper that complements his live saving skills and occupation. This handy water bottle will be just perfect for his medical schedules.Your gift contains: a sipper','Drink Aid','Drink Aid','Drink Aid','Drink Aid'),(898,1,'Travel Mug','After hectic schedules and late hours work, a doctor does need a little liesure too. Send this travel mug to him as he plans to break away from a regular strenous schedules. Your gift contain: A Travel Mug','Travel Mug','Travel Mug','Travel Mug','Travel Mug'),(899,1,'Whats the time Doc','A wall clock is an essential thing for any space. It adds a very important value to the dcor of a place. Send this amazing time piece to your doctor as a small token of gratitude this Doctor\'s Day! Your gift contains: A Wall Clock','Whats the time Doc','Whats the time Doc','Whats the time Doc','Whats the time Doc'),(900,1,'Galore of Cherishment','&lt;p&gt;Help your daughter to add-on to her beauty by gifting her this amazing Heart Shaped Pocket Mirror. What makes this mirror a perfect gift for your daughter is its alluring baby pink color, shape of heart and the beautiful message printed upon A Daughter is a Gift of Love.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Small Heart Shape Pocket Mirror&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Galore of Cherishment','Galore of Cherishment','Galore of Cherishment','Galore of Cherishment'),(901,1,'Framed to Charm','&lt;p&gt;Make this Daughter\'s Day one of the most memorable moments of your Daughter\'s life by letting her know what she means to you. Such a job can be flawlessly done through the offered Frame by Ferns N Petals. The picture in the frame quotes, I\'m As Lucky As Can Be for the World\'s Most Beautiful Daughter Belongs to Me.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One A-4 Size Frame&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Framed to Charm','Framed to Charm','Framed to Charm','Framed to Charm'),(902,1,'Diary of Dreams','&lt;p&gt;Gift your Daughter something amazing on which she can pour out her beautiful thoughts. Ferns N Petals brings forth a Pink colored Diary for your princess onto which she can express her desires and thoughts. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Pink Note Book 8x6 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Diary of Dreams','Diary of Dreams','Diary of Dreams','Diary of Dreams'),(903,1,'Golden Rose','&lt;p&gt;Roses have been the timeless symbol of love. Choose a wonderful way to show your sweetheart that your love will last forever. The timeless beauty of this golden rose speaks for itself and adds elegance to the day. Get this valentine gift for a lifetime of pleasure and enjoyment.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 6 inch gold plated rose.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Once in a while, right in the middle of an ordinary life, love gives us a fairy tale.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Golden Rose','Golden Rose','Golden Rose','Golden Rose'),(904,1,'Greetings for the Princess','&lt;p&gt;A lovely surprise for your little princess, Ferns N Petals bring forth an adorable greeting card to be presented on the occasion of Daughter\'s Day. The charm of this greeting card is enhanced much more by the graceful message it quotes, DaughterA€¦ A little blessing from heaven above &amp; one of the God\'s most beautiful creations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Greeting Card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Greetings for the Princess','Greetings for the Princess','Greetings for the Princess','Greetings for the Princess'),(905,1,'Trendy Brown Notebook','&lt;p&gt;Your search for corporate gift ends here. This exclusive brown notebook is sure to win the race of best corporate gifts. It is sure to make a very thoughtful and memorable gift.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Brown Notebook 9x7 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Trendy Brown Notebook','Trendy Brown Notebook','Trendy Brown Notebook','Trendy Brown Notebook'),(906,1,'The Serenity of Love','&lt;p&gt;What could be better than the Daughter\'s Day to tell her, what a blessing she is to your life? Present her the most alluring and desired gifts, she ever dreamt of, a sublime set of Necklace &amp; Earrings, a pretty Pocket Mirror, a classy Coffee Mug and a graceful Greeting Card, reflecting your warmth of love towards her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Small Heart Shape Pocket Mirror&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Greeting Card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;White and Cream Mug with Print&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Necklace Set(Necklace and Earrings)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The Serenity of Love','The Serenity of Love','The Serenity of Love','The Serenity of Love'),(907,1,'Show your Attitude','&lt;p&gt;A personalized notebook is perfect gift for anyone. This stylish gift in dark brown color is ideal to gift in corporates, as it suffice the best way of corporate needs and have premium look.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Dark Brown Notebook 8.5x5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Show your Attitude','Show your Attitude','Show your Attitude','Show your Attitude'),(908,1,'Forever Silver Roses','&lt;p&gt;Choose the greatest symbol of love to express your love for your sweetheart. Keep the glory of rose forever with this silver forever rose. Fresh rose when dipped in silver creates an everlasting rose, like your love. It\'s timeless beauty speaks for itself and adds elegance to the day.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 6 inch silver plated forever rose.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&quot;You are the answer to every prayer I have offered. You are a song, a dream, a whisper, and I dont know how I could have lived without you for as long as I have.&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Forever Silver Roses','Forever Silver Roses','Forever Silver Roses','Forever Silver Roses'),(909,1,'Another Milestone','&lt;p&gt;It may be easy to be the boss, but it is never easy to be the leader. Present your token of thanks to the leader of the organization by gifting this motivating Table Top, which reads Building the Empire.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brown Table Top&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Another Milestone','Another Milestone','Another Milestone','Another Milestone'),(910,1,'Lit with Style','&lt;p&gt;A stunning scented candle in blue glass pot is perfect for any special occasion. This gorgeous candle makes a stunning gift for any occasion. Give it as a token of appreciation to feel your dear ones even more special.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Scented Candle in Blue Glass Pot height 5 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Lit with Style','Lit with Style','Lit with Style','Lit with Style'),(911,1,'Sporty Key Ring','&lt;p&gt;Express your sole relation gifting someone special this black key ring. Super light to carry, it helps to keep your keys secured. This key ring is perfect to make your bond stronger.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Black Keyring 4 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sporty Key Ring','Sporty Key Ring','Sporty Key Ring','Sporty Key Ring'),(912,1,'Expressive Candles','&lt;p&gt;Light the happiness in your dear one\'s life by gifting them with this exclusive set of red decorative candle. Gift your dear ones on their anniversary, which is sure to brighten not only their special day, but, also years ahead. Leave a forever mark in their heart with this exclusive candles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 Red Decorative Candle 3 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Expressive Candles','Expressive Candles','Expressive Candles','Expressive Candles'),(913,1,'Perfect New Year Candle','&lt;p&gt;This exclusive white cylindrical candle is sure to entice you and one whom you gift it. With Happy New Year quotation on the front, it becomes perfect gifting item for New Year. It is a perfect buy for dï¿½cor of your room or can be placed infront of idol.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 White Candle height 3 inches &amp; diameter 2 inches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Perfect New Year Candle','Perfect New Year Candle','Perfect New Year Candle','Perfect New Year Candle'),(914,1,'Celebrate Year of Togetherness','&lt;p&gt;A personalized gift that stands out of all other gifts. This iPhone back cover with New Year quotation make an awesome cover out of it. A perfect utility gift that is sure to keep your mobile safe and secure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Iphone Back cover(4 ,5 &amp; 6 size)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Celebrate Year of Togetherness','Celebrate Year of Togetherness','Celebrate Year of Togetherness','Celebrate Year of Togetherness'),(915,1,'Radha Kishan Statue','This Radha Kishan Statue from the house of Ferns N Petals makes up a perfect gift for wishing a \'Happy Married Life\' to a couple on their wedding, blessing people on their anniversaries, birthdays, and other occasions. This statue is made from pure brass by the skilled artisans. Size 4 inches.','Radha Kishan Statue','Radha Kishan Statue','Radha Kishan Statue','Radha Kishan Statue'),(916,1,'Forever Red Rose','&lt;p&gt;Love lasts forever ! Literally an eternal symbol of love, this red rose will last forever. It looks and feel as fresh as the day it was picked. This fresh rose has been preserved to stay and look fresh for years. Give your love a gift as pretty as she is.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;They can last several years if properly cared, just keep the flowers indoors, away from direct sunlight, heat, humidity and moisture. If the flowers becomes dusty, use a hairdryer or another type of gentle blower on a cool setting to clean.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One preserved red rose in a gift box. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;If I had a flower for every time I thought of you, I could walk through my garden forever.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Forever Red Rose','Forever Red Rose','Forever Red Rose','Forever Red Rose'),(917,1,'Engraved Golden Rose','&lt;p&gt;This Forever Rose is a wonderful way to show your sweetheart that your love will last forever. From time immemorial roses have been the greatest symbol of love. It\'s timeless beauty speaks for itself and adds elegance to the day. Get this valentine gift with your love message engraved on it.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; One 11 inch gold plated I love you engraved forever rose.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;You are the answer to every prayer I\'ve offered. You are a song, a dream, a whisper, and I don\'t know how I could have lived without you for as long as I have.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Engraved Golden Rose','Engraved Golden Rose','Engraved Golden Rose','Engraved Golden Rose'),(918,1,'Pink Wooden Tray Combo','Pink Wooden Tray Combo\' is a delightful present, an ideal pick for your special lady. This comprises of 3 Dairy Milk Chocolates of 16 grams each, One Round Pearls Candle, One Two-Layered Bamboo Plant for good luck and One Pink Box.','Pink Wooden Tray Combo','Pink Wooden Tray Combo','Pink Wooden Tray Combo','Pink Wooden Tray Combo'),(919,1,'Fruits Candies Basket','Deliciously addictive, these simple fruit candies have an intense flavor and a consistency vaguely reminiscent of soft gumdrops. So share edible gifts this year with your friends and family and sweeten their days. Get an amazing hamper of 190 grams fruit jelly candies in pink basket along with 2 round pink candles and 2.5 inches small pink teddy bear from Ferns N Petals and brighten up the day for someone with happy flavours.','Fruits Candies Basket','Fruits Candies Basket','Fruits Candies Basket','Fruits Candies Basket'),(920,1,'Classic Indian Rasgulla','One does not need a reason to have the tasty Rasgulla and therefore, Ferns N Petals has come up with the one kilograms Pack of Rasgulla. You can either buy this Classic Indian Rasgulla for yourself or send it across to your family and friends on several occasions.','Classic Indian Rasgulla','Classic Indian Rasgulla','Classic Indian Rasgulla','Classic Indian Rasgulla'),(921,1,'Pista Burfi In Silver Tray','Nothing can replace the desire for traditional sweets when it comes to celebrate happiness with our loved ones, be it any occasion, like from birthdays and marriages to Rakhi and Diwali. Knowing this, Ferns N Petals has come up with this special Silver Tray filled with tasty Pista Burfi in 500 grams.','Pista Burfi In Silver Tray','Pista Burfi In Silver Tray','Pista Burfi In Silver Tray','Pista Burfi In Silver Tray'),(922,1,'Jelly Candy N Candle In Basket','Enter into the world of soft chewy jelly candies which will transport you to new world of vibrant colour and amazing flavours. Get a flavourful hamper of 190 grams of jelly candies in a blue basket and 2 round yellow candles from Ferns N Petals and treat your friends and family with all time favourite jellies.','Jelly Candy N Candle In Basket','Jelly Candy N Candle In Basket','Jelly Candy N Candle In Basket','Jelly Candy N Candle In Basket'),(923,1,'The Love for Sweets','&lt;p&gt;Sweets are the cute excuses to enjoy the celebrations and make the days much more delighted. Send the happiness packed in a box, in the form of this Pista Barfi and share the happiness with your dear ones. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Pista Burfi 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The Love for Sweets','The Love for Sweets','The Love for Sweets','The Love for Sweets'),(924,1,'Badam Pinni','Pinni is one of the most famous Punjabi traditional sweets, liked by one and all to add a pinch of sweetness and love in all celebrations. Owing to this, Ferns N Petals has introduced 500gm Pack of Pinni.','Badam Pinni','Badam Pinni','Badam Pinni','Badam Pinni'),(925,1,'Classic Soan Halwa','&lt;p&gt;Soan Halwa is known to be one of the best sweets made in India. Share a tin can of this temping sweet with your friends and relatives to enjoy the day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Soan Halwa 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Classic Soan Halwa','Classic Soan Halwa','Classic Soan Halwa','Classic Soan Halwa'),(926,1,'Elegant Soan Cakes','&lt;p&gt;A box of sweets like Soan Cake do not require any special reason for presenting it. Present this to your dear ones and let them enjoy the moments of deliciousness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Soan Cake 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Elegant Soan Cakes','Elegant Soan Cakes','Elegant Soan Cakes','Elegant Soan Cakes'),(927,1,'Rasbhari Reward','&lt;p&gt;Delight your loved ones on their special days with something as special as the offered sweets by Ferns N Petals. This can of Kesar Rasbhari will be delivering fresh and juicy sweets to them, with a subtle message of your love and care.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Tin Kesar Rasbhari 1000gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Rasbhari Reward','Rasbhari Reward','Rasbhari Reward','Rasbhari Reward'),(928,1,'Lip Smacking Cham Cham','&lt;p&gt;Nothing can replace the desire for traditional Indian sweets when it comes to celebrate happiness with our loved ones, be it any occasion, like from birthdays and marriages to Rakhi and Diwali. Knowing this, Ferns N Petals has come up with this special Pack of tasty Cham Cham in one kilogram pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Tin Cham 1000gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Lip Smacking Cham Cham','Lip Smacking Cham Cham','Lip Smacking Cham Cham','Lip Smacking Cham Cham'),(929,1,'The Tender Gulab Jamun','&lt;p&gt;People do not need an occasion to relish the taste of the most delicious sweets of India. Specially, when it comes to Gulab Jamun, there is nothing that can beat their amazing taste. For such, Ferns N Petals brings forth this 1 kilogram pack of Gulab Jamun, which you can present to your friends and family and gain appreciation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Tin Gulab Jamun 1000gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','The Tender Gulab Jamun','The Tender Gulab Jamun','The Tender Gulab Jamun','The Tender Gulab Jamun'),(930,1,'Taste of Affection','&lt;p&gt;Ferns N Petals brings forth a special combo for the special celebrations in the loves of your loved ones. Present them with the offered combo of 250 grams pack of Soan Papdi &amp; 500 grams pack of Besan Laddoos and make the celebrations even more joyous.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Besan Laddoo 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Soan Papdi 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Taste of Affection','Taste of Affection','Taste of Affection','Taste of Affection'),(931,1,'A Preset of Love','&lt;p&gt;Present a treat to the taste buds of your loved ones by offering them something delicious. And for such, there can e nothing better than this offered 250 grams pack of Dry Petha.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Dry Petha 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','A Preset of Love','A Preset of Love','A Preset of Love','A Preset of Love'),(932,1,'Taste and Health','&lt;p&gt;What can be better than a present that not only treat the taste buds, but also take care of the health. This is made possible by ferns N Petals that offers a 250 grams pack of Dry Khajoor Barfi to delight your loved ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Khajoori Dry fruit Barfi 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Taste and Health','Taste and Health','Taste and Health','Taste and Health'),(933,1,'Rosy Delights','&lt;p&gt;A present that will not only delight the senses, but also mesmerize with its heavenly mild fragrance, this is a 250 grams pack of Rose Bite sweets offered by Ferns N Petals to charm your loved ones with your kind gesture of presenting it to them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Rose Bite 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Rosy Delights','Rosy Delights','Rosy Delights','Rosy Delights'),(934,1,'Sweet Temptation','&lt;p&gt;The best of the sweets served with the best of the feelings is all you need to present to your loved ones to let them know how important they are to you. So, gift them with this 250 grams box of Soan Papdi and let them know elegantly that you care. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Soan Papdi 250gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Sweet Temptation','Sweet Temptation','Sweet Temptation','Sweet Temptation'),(935,1,'Yellow Surprise','&lt;p&gt;All you need to celebrate special days in the lives of your loved ones is a pack of sweets that is loved by all and Ferns N petals brings you that in a 500 grams pack. So, present your loved ones with the offered pack of tempting Moti Choor Laddoos and make their special days much more special.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Moti Choor Laddoo 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Yellow Surprise','Yellow Surprise','Yellow Surprise','Yellow Surprise'),(936,1,'Excuse to Celebrate','&lt;p&gt;Punjabi Cuisine is considered to be one of the most delicious and healthy cuisines in the world and so are the sweets. Send your loved ones the offered 500 grams pack of Special Pinni and let them get lost in the deliciousness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; SPL. Pinni 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Excuse to Celebrate','Excuse to Celebrate','Excuse to Celebrate','Excuse to Celebrate'),(937,1,'Necessity of a Celebration','&lt;p&gt;The special days in the lives are worth celebrating and these celebrations are completed with the sweets. So, complete the celebrations in the lives of your loved ones by sending them the offered 500 grams pack of Doda Barfi and share the happiness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Doda Burfi 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Necessity of a Celebration','Necessity of a Celebration','Necessity of a Celebration','Necessity of a Celebration'),(938,1,'Time to Celebrate','&lt;p&gt;Celebration are the highlights of the life and sweets are the highlights of the celebrations. Make the celebrations more special for your dear ones by gifting them this offered 500 grams pack of Pista Barfi. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Pista Burfi 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Time to Celebrate','Time to Celebrate','Time to Celebrate','Time to Celebrate'),(939,1,'Gesture of Affection','&lt;p&gt;For the people who have an eternal love for the Besan Laddoos, Ferns N Petals offers this 500 grams pack of the most delicious Besan Laddoos. Present it to the Laddoo lovers and see their faces lit up with the beautiful smiles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Besan Laddoo 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Gesture of Affection','Gesture of Affection','Gesture of Affection','Gesture of Affection'),(940,1,'Kesari Fun','&lt;p&gt;The delight of the famous world famous Petha is what you need to present your relatives and friends on their special days. The offered Kesar Angoori Petha will serve as a delightful treat to them and will bring loads of appreciation in return. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Panchhi Kesar Angoori 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Kesari Fun','Kesari Fun','Kesari Fun','Kesari Fun'),(941,1,'Betel Delight','&lt;p&gt;Pan Petha is one of the most loved Petha across the globe. Its crunchy and sweet refreshing taste is what makes it so special. Turn the occasions and celebrations more special for your loved ones by sending them the offered 12 pieces pack of Pan Petha.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Panchhi Pan Petha 12 pc&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Betel Delight','Betel Delight','Betel Delight','Betel Delight'),(942,1,'Box of Celebrations','&lt;p&gt;If your dear ones love chocolates and sweets, there can never be a better gift for them than this. Ferns N Petals brings this amazing delight of 500 grams pack of Chocolate Petha that you can present to the sweet lovers in your life. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Gift Contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Panchhi Chocolate Petha 500gms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;','Box of Celebrations','Box of Celebrations','Box of Celebrations','Box of Celebrations'),(943,1,'The Royal Feast','&lt;p&gt;For 